INSERT INTO `product_faqs` VALUES (17,'Is the item durable?','Yes',96),(23,'it is original','yes 100% authentic',102),(26,'is this original?','yes',105),(29,'ffff','ffff',107),(33,'Aut est qui dolorem aperiam quia quia quis et dolo','uyuy',93),(34,'Aut est qui dolorem aperiam quia quia quis et dolo','dsfasdfasd',93),(42,'How do I return my item','Simply click on the RETURN section and print your shipping label. You can drop your item off at any USPS store.',117),(61,'How many types of ducks do you have','Just Drake Wood duck',124),(67,'Start with a brief overview','Start with a brief overview that describes your item\'s reason for beign produced.Tell buyers how it will benefit society.',95),(76,'Delivery','Delivery will take 2 to 4 weeks from the purchase date.',129),(77,'Important Check Before Purchasing Electronics','1. All the electronics in our store are shipped from the U.S.\r\n2. U.S. Voltage is 110V ~ 120V, 60Hz and plug may be different.\r\n3. You may require transformers and plug converters(adapters).\r\n4. Transformer must be used.(110v to 200~240v )\r\n5. It may be difficult to returned because of the difference of voltage.',129),(88,'werer','rdtre',132),(89,'is this original','yes',133),(99,'Are these Seasonings really Organic','Yes every product that Pure Leaf Creates is 100% Organic. The Crisp pure taste will ensure that.',152),(100,'Will these fit in folding chairs?','Yes..it will fit in a folding chairs perfectly. I\'ve used it before.',158),(101,'Is the material really thin? and will it cover a d','It will not work in a chair with arms and yes very thin',158),(102,'How far will material stretch?','The material stretch is good, workable for 19 inch between front legs.',158),(103,'Is this product Organic.','Yes all Products are Fully Organic. Every product that Pure Leaf sells are Organic',159),(104,'Does this product come in different size bags','Yes we carry 5lb and 20lb Bags also',160),(114,'How heavy are the models?','These are the different weight specifications for each pan: \r\n28 cm wok - 1438 gram \r\n28 cm frying pan - 1355 gram \r\n24 cm frying pan - 1070 gram',164),(115,'What temperatures can the pans withstand?','TÜV tested our pans and concluded that they can withstand temperatures of up to 300 degrees Celsius. We used a safety margin of 50 degrees Celsius and can say with 100% certainty that 250 degrees Celsius won’t be a problem.',164),(116,'What is the size of the mini 2?','It is 5.25 x 4 x 5 inches and weights around 7 ounces.',167),(150,'How many pixels can a person get out of a game or the image given?','This products supports up to 4K and has new high quality resolution that will seem like an individual is really in the landscape of the game.  The VR technology is new and the best quality and experience a person can have.',170),(157,'What are the pans made of','The pan consists of the following layers: \r\nOuter Layer - SUS 430 Stainless Steel \r\nMiddle Layer - 1050 Aluminum \r\nInner Layer - SUS 304 Stainless Steel \r\nBlackbeard Honeycomb Framework',122),(158,'Is the Blackbeard Armada Cookware set dishwasher p','Yes, it is! The pans are designed to be completely dishwasher proof.',122),(159,'Is the complete Blackbeard Armada Cookware set ind','Yes, it is! Thanks to the aluminum core that evenly distributes the heat over the entire pans The Blackbeard Complete Armada set is suitable for all heat sources, including induction.',122),(160,'What temperatures can the pans withstand','TÜV tested our pans and concluded that they can withstand temperatures of up to 300 degrees Celsius. We used a safety margin of 50 degrees Celsius and can say with 100% certainty that 250 degrees Celsius won’t be a problem.',122),(161,'I see in some of the images that the sauce pans an','Yes, lids are included by the casseroles and frying pans in the reward tiers',122),(162,'What Are The Pans Made of the What Are The Pans Ma','TÜV Tested Our Pans And Concluded That They Can Withstand Temperatures Of Up To 300 Degrees Celsius. We Used A Safety Margin Of 50 Degrees Celsius And Can Say With 100% Certainty That 250 Degrees Celsius Won’t Be A Problem. TÜV Tested Our Pans And Concluded That They Can Withstand Temperatures Of Up To 300 Degrees Celsius. We Used A Safety Margin Of 50 Degrees Celsius And Can Say With 100% Certainty That 250 Degrees Celsius Won’t Be A Problem.',122),(163,'Q: What Are The Pans Made Of The What Are The Pans','The Pan Consists Of The Following Layers: Outer Layer - SUS 430 Stainless Steel Middle Layer - 1050 Aluminum Inner Layer - SUS 304 Stainless Steel Blackbeard Honeycomb Framework...The Pan Consists Of The Following Layers: Outer Layer - SUS 430 Stainless Steel Middle Layer - 1050 Aluminum Inner Layer - SUS 304 Stainless Steel Blackbeard Honeycomb Framework..The Pan Consists Of The Following Layers: Outer Layer - SUS 430 Stainless Steel Middle Layer - 1050 Aluminum Inner Layer - SUS 304 Stainless Steel Blackbeard Honeycomb Framework',122),(165,'What kind of warranty comes with the saw.','A 3 month warranty and year parts and labor warranty.',178),(166,'Is this Product Really Reclaimed Wood','Yes all products are custom built to order with Reclaimed wood',182),(167,'Does this phone come wity Accesories','Yes Razr comes with Recharge Dock and Recharge Cord',185),(168,'Is this Bike new','Yes New never preowned',186),(169,'Is Vessel Glass','Yes Vessel is Constructed with Glass Componets',187),(170,'Are these slip resistant?','Did not experience any slipping. Spent time on tile, asphalt and concrete',191),(171,'Can you tell me more about meal worm?','Mealworms are fascinating! \r\nSome cool facts: \r\n••They are grown in space by Chinese astronauts as space food! \r\n••A reference to the composition of the mealworm can inhibit the BACE enzyme, which is a key enzyme to cause Alzheimer\'s disease. \r\n••The dried mealworm can be made into powder, which is called Hanxia powder in China and added to many foods to make it tasting fresh. \r\n••The essential oils of the mealworm are often extracted in order to be used as a skin oil for humans. It contains lots of Vitamin B5, vital for skin renewal.',192),(172,'Can I use my own seeds?','Yes, you can. However, we recommend using aspara™ seed capsules, as we have developed unique planting programs for our selected seeds.',193),(173,'What if I\'m out of seed capsule?','We are going to offer a wide range of seed capsules in the near future. Please stay tuned and follow our website www.aspara.hk and social media (Facebook, Instagram, and Twitter)! We are going to provide regional support for our customers.',193),(174,'What scent does your man wear','Sauvage Eau de parfum',194),(178,'Is it world wide shipping?','Yes we can ship this product any where in Europe with additional shipping cost.',196),(227,'Start with a brief overview','Start with a brief overviewStart with a brief overviewStart with a brief overviewStart with a brief overview',198),(282,'How much meat can fit into the 8 quart Instant Pot?','I\'ve done a 6lb boneless leg of lamb, a 5lb pot roast, and at least 5 pounds of pork shoulder',201),(283,'how much can the 3 Quart Hold? I am single and cooking for one.','It depends on what you plan on cooking. I started with a 3 qt, but moved up to the 8 qt since I wanted to use it primarily for cooking beans. In the 3 qt, 8 oz is pushing it.',201),(284,'Can blender purée leafy vegetables like spinach and kale in greens?','Yes, it does....I tried spinach and kale in my smoothies many times. It turned out perfect every single time!',203),(285,'What\'s the minimum and maximum dial?','Vanaheim Blender has variable speed dial from 0 (stop) to 9 (highest). If you would like to process with nut butter, you can simply use the preset program of Nut Butter---the auto mode.',203),(286,'Will I automatically charged if I back your project?','No! You will not be automatically charged as soon as you back my project. You will be charged at the end of the project if it is successfully funded.',204),(287,'Is there a charger for the FreshVac attachment?','You can buy a plug attachment but it’s not a charger.',205),(288,'How do we put pictures in this?','You just need to remove the backing of the frame and place this pictures inside and secure the backing.',208),(289,'What size should pictures be printed?','Some of the frames I gave away with photos but I think with mats were 8x10/5x7/4x6',208),(290,'How Many Pages On A Hardcover ?','266 pages in total.',211),(294,'Is this item easy to use?','Yes',125),(296,'Is it original ?','yes',101),(297,'What will be the delivery duration ?','Within 14 days',101),(306,'Is it waterproof?','Yes.',162),(307,'Is it Original?','Yes',163),(310,'Is this Organic ?','No , it contains chemicals',97),(318,'is it used?','NO',135),(320,'Is it 100% original ?','Yes, we only deal with Original products.',94),(321,'is it original ?','yes',106),(322,'Is it Original?','YES',197),(323,'test ?','test',216),(325,'Are you searching for best luxury watches for women in Pakistan? If Ye','By keeping luxury, comfort, and class in mind, Sveston presents some of the hottest women\'s luxury watches in 2021. These watches are desirable and fashionable, and also very economical and reasonable when it comes to price. These are the top 5 luxury women watches of 2021 Sveston has in store for you.',226),(326,'What will be the delivery timings ?','Within 23 working days',199);
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `product_faqs` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

