e bottom.<br />\r\n14k Gold ear wires finish the design.<br />\r\nEarrings measure 1.75 inches from the top of ear wire.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTiger&#39;s Eye is worn to ward of evil spirits and the &quot;evil eye&quot;.</p>',240,NULL,237,'2326',1,'1',358,'a:0:{}','1','1','1','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',19,NULL,NULL,0,70,2,25,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-23 10:13:38','2018-11-23 11:06:46'),(110,14,8,'Thick gold hoop - creole - earrings - go','thick-gold-hoop-creole-earrings-go','Sterling silver chunky rounded creole hoop earrings available in Sterling Silver, 18ct Yellow gold vermeil plate or 18ct Rose gold vermeil plate. Sold as a pair (same size)','<p>Sterling silver chunky rounded creole hoop earrings available in Sterling Silver, 18ct Yellow gold vermeil plate or 18ct Rose gold vermeil plate. Sold as a pair (same size)</p>',300,NULL,325,'3655',1,'2',359,'a:0:{}','1','1','1','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',31,NULL,NULL,0,70,2,25,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-23 10:16:09','2019-01-14 09:43:59'),(111,14,8,'Colorful Tassel Earrings with PomPoms','colorful-tassel-earrings-with-pompoms','Long Tassel Earrings with PomPoms , Colorful Clip-On Earrings, Pom Pom Earrings, Tribal Earrings, Boho Soutache Earrings, Handmade Earrings','<p>Long Tassel Earrings with PomPoms , Colorful Clip-On Earrings, Pom Pom Earrings, Tribal Earrings, Boho Soutache Earrings, Handmade Earrings</p>',560,NULL,347,'22656',3,'1',360,'a:0:{}','3','3','3','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',19,NULL,NULL,0,52,2,43,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-23 10:19:24','2018-12-05 10:39:52'),(112,17,9,'Lemonayo - Spread the Culture','lemonayo-spread-the-culture','','<p>We started our journey with the&nbsp;purpose&nbsp;of offering a better pet food &ndash;<strong>&nbsp;<em>one that&rsquo;s nutritious and also reflects our ethical values as animal lovers.</em></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>At Purpose, we believe you shouldn&rsquo;t have to worry about what&rsquo;s in your pet&rsquo;s bowl or how the ingredients got there.&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.gearpatrol.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/Guide-to-Quartz-Watches-gear-patrol-lead-full.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Speedmaster wasn&rsquo;t the only watch worn on the moon &mdash; during the Apollo 15 mission</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.gearpatrol.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/Guide-to-Quartz-Watches-gear-patrol-Junghans-max-bill-MEGA.jpg\" /></p>',500,NULL,10,'55',20,'1',384,'a:2:{i:0;s:3:\"385\";i:1;s:3:\"386\";}','50.','10.4','100.4','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',29,NULL,6,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2018-11-23 13:33:32','2019-05-09 10:09:14'),(113,18,10,'Paul Parkman Handmade Lace-Up','paul-parkman-handmade-lace-up','Casual shoes with leather sole\r\nBrown Hand-Painted leather upper\r\nFinest Italian calfskin\r\nHandcrafted patterns on upper\r\nLeather wrapped laces','<p>Casual shoes with leather sole<br />\r\nBrown Hand-Painted leather upper<br />\r\nFinest Italian calfskin<br />\r\nHandcrafted patterns on upper<br />\r\nLeather wrapped laces<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>',500,NULL,27,'256698',5,'1',387,NULL,'5','5','5','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',29,NULL,NULL,0,70,2,25,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-23 13:33:37','2018-11-23 13:33:37'),(114,18,10,'men boots handmade','men-boots-handmade','Quality men leather and anatomic boots with anatomic insole, with inside soft warm material to keep you warm from outside weather conditions, greek handmade shoes, with laces, stitched crepe sole.\r\nEvery man deserve a quality pair of shoes!','<p>Quality men leather and anatomic boots with anatomic insole, with inside soft warm material to keep you warm from outside weather conditions, greek handmade shoes, with laces, stitched crepe sole.<br />\r\nEvery man deserve a quality pair of shoes!</p>',680,NULL,13,'326665',7,'1',388,NULL,'7','7','7','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',23,NULL,NULL,0,70,2,25,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-23 13:39:53','2018-11-23 13:39:53'),(115,21,12,'BIO180','bio180','Age reversal and performance system.','<p>Rejuvenate TEL+Homeopathic<br />\r\n2 fl oz (59ml) 2-month supply</p>\r\n\r\n<p>20% ethanol</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Drug Facts<br />\r\nActive Ingredients<br />\r\nAneglica sinesis 6X<br />\r\nAstaxanthin 6X<br />\r\nAstragaloside IV 3X, 6X, 9X Astragalus membranaceus 4X, 6X, 9X Carduus marianus 6X</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Colostrum bovine 6X Crataegus oxyacantha 6X Curcuma longa 4X Cycloastragenol 3X, 6X, 9X Epidemium 6X</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fallopia japonica 4X Gotu kola 4X Nattokinase 6X<br />\r\nPiper nigrum 4X Portulaca oleracea 6X Terminalia chebula 4X</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thymus suis 6X<br />\r\nWithania somnifera 6XInactive Ingredients<br />\r\nEthanol 20% v/v, Purified water USP.Uses</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Supports telomeres while helping to prevent telomere loss and damage; supports cardiovascular, hormonal and organ health by helping to maintain normal organ and tissue function.<br />\r\nDirections<br />\r\nAdults, two sprays under the tongue, three times per day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Warnings</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keep out of reach of children.<br />\r\nDo not use&nbsp;if tamper evident seal is broken.<br />\r\nDo not use&nbsp;if you have ever had an allergic reaction to this product or any of its ingredients.<br />\r\nStop use and ask a health care professional if&nbsp;symptoms persist, worsen or if new symptoms occur.If pregnant or breast feeding,&nbsp;ask a health care professional before using product.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Other information</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Store at room temperature away from direct sunlight.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',495,NULL,9993,NULL,2,'1',392,'a:1:{i:0;i:397;}','8','2.5','9','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',13,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-23 16:03:40','2018-11-23 16:09:56'),(116,21,12,'BIO180 2','bio180-2','','<p>Rejuvenate TEL+Homeopathic<br />\r\n2 fl oz (59ml) 2-month supply</p>\r\n\r\n<p>20% ethanol</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Drug Facts<br />\r\nActive Ingredients<br />\r\nAneglica sinesis 6X<br />\r\nAstaxanthin 6X<br />\r\nAstragaloside IV 3X, 6X, 9X Astragalus membranaceus 4X, 6X, 9X Carduus marianus 6X</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Colostrum bovine 6X Crataegus oxyacantha 6X Curcuma longa 4X Cycloastragenol 3X, 6X, 9X Epidemium 6X</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fallopia japonica 4X Gotu kola 4X Nattokinase 6X<br />\r\nPiper nigrum 4X Portulaca oleracea 6X Terminalia chebula 4X</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thymus suis 6X<br />\r\nWithania somnifera 6XInactive Ingredients<br />\r\nEthanol 20% v/v, Purified water USP.Uses</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Supports telomeres while helping to prevent telomere loss and damage; supports cardiovascular, hormonal and organ health by helping to maintain normal organ and tissue function.<br />\r\nDirections<br />\r\nAdults, two sprays under the tongue, three times per day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Warnings</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keep out of reach of children.<br />\r\nDo not use if tamper evident seal is broken.<br />\r\nDo not use if you have ever had an allergic reaction to this product or any of its ingredients.<br />\r\nStop use and ask a health care professional if symptoms persist, worsen or if new symptoms occur.If pregnant or breast feeding, ask a health care professional before using product.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Other information</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Store at room temperature away from direct sunlight.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>',495,NULL,9929,NULL,2,'1',393,'a:0:{}','8','2.5','9','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',77,NULL,19,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,1,0,'2018-11-23 16:03:44','2019-03-06 06:53:56'),(117,20,11,'Cassedy Nubuck Womens High Heel','cassedy-nubuck-womens-high-heel','Sexy, timeless and chic all at once --','<p>Sexy, timeless and chic all at once -- this nubuck leather pump is a year-round essential. Features a lower-cut vamp (can you say toe cleavage) and a high-coverage heel for a play on proportion.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>3&quot; Heel Height</li>\r\n	<li>Suede leather uppper</li>\r\n	<li>Synthetic outsole&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>',40,NULL,0,'123456789',2.5,'1',394,'a:0:{}','15','10','8','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',6,NULL,NULL,0,70,2,25,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-23 16:04:54','2018-11-23 16:44:49'),(118,20,11,'Mens Zerogrand Wingtip Oxford','mens-zerogrand-wingtip-oxford','Men\'s ØriginalGrand Wingtip Oxford','<ul>\r\n	<li>Wingtip oxford in leather uppers.</li>\r\n	<li>EVA midsole with rubber outsole.</li>\r\n	<li>Cushioned with Grand.&Oslash;S technology for ultimate comfort.</li>\r\n</ul>',50,NULL,0,'123456780',3,'1',398,NULL,'15','10','8','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',16,NULL,NULL,0,60,2,35,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-23 16:21:29','2018-11-23 16:21:29'),(119,21,12,'BIOHGH','biohgh','Homeopathic HGH Spray','<p>Recapture HGHHomeopathic<br />\r\n2 fl oz (59ml) 2-month supply</p>\r\n\r\n<p>20% ethanol</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Drug Facts<br />\r\nActive Ingredients<br />\r\nHuman growth hormone 30X IGF-1 30X<br />\r\nPituitarum 30X<br />\r\nHepar suis 6X<br />\r\nPhosphoricum acidum 3XInactive Ingredients<br />\r\nEthanol 20% v/v, Purified water USP.Uses</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Clinical studies suggest the following types of symptom relief associated with aging: poor muscle/fat balance, low stamina and energy, decrease in sexual function, sleeplessness, weak immune system, irritability, poor memory, dry wrinkled skin.<br />\r\nDirections</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Adults, two sprays under the tongue, three times per day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Warnings</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Other information</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Store at room temperature away from direct sunlight.</p>',595,NULL,99937,'B100',1.5,'1',400,'a:0:{}','6','7','2','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',69,NULL,NULL,0,70,2,25,'all',NULL,NULL,1,0,'2018-11-23 16:21:40','2018-11-23 16:28:44'),(120,20,11,'Cassedy Black Nubuck Heel','cassedy-black-nubuck-heel','Sexy, timeless and chic all at once --','<p>&nbsp;this nubuck leather pump is a year-round essential. Features a lower-cut vamp (can you say toe cleavage) and a high-coverage heel for a play on proportion.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Heel Height 3&quot;</li>\r\n	<li>Suede Leather Upper</li>\r\n	<li>Rubber Outsole</li>\r\n</ul>',40,NULL,0,'123456789',2.5,'1',401,NULL,'15','10','8','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',16,NULL,NULL,0,70,2,25,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-23 16:48:00','2018-11-23 16:48:00'),(121,21,12,'BIO300','bio300','Magic Potion',NULL,995,NULL,9992,'B300',1,'1',403,NULL,'7','3','8','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',14,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-23 17:28:38','2018-11-23 17:28:38'),(122,22,14,'CROWD COOKWARE','crowd-cookware','','<h3>About</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/044/3f6e8771ed6448290eea8382192a7766_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541663277&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=6590f35672d788587d0ab0871a59c0cf\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/089/347/03330b40ac6c26f6009f4af60a461b2c_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540981931&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=6dda5d35e6cefb107bf9c20cbc228667\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"http://bit.ly/2B0noHq\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/089/350/8c92e5530e63f24588dfcb34f949b684_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540981964&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=ab4e89833493bf9751c2851cf8b1d37e\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"http://bit.ly/2B0noHq\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The Blackbeard Armada Cookware set is based upon this summer&rsquo;s biggest food success on Kickstarter:</strong>&nbsp;the Blackbeard frying pan. We never imagined our initial goal of &euro;50.000 would turn into &euro;332.437 so fast: more than 3,400 backers from across the seven seas helped us bring the Blackbeard to life. Wow, thank you so much!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>During our Blackbeard campaign, more than 800 backers provided us with feedback: they wanted more! In the spirit of the holidays, we created the Blackbeard Armada: a tribute to our backers and to the success of the Blackbeard.&nbsp;We invite everyone to join this campaign!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/231/089/de1d69e5096a18425271eea50540f1f0_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1542027232&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=5bf8790667bc456b7733480cc045d501\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/132/7a50297a6af76c48b94a9c9d858b239b_original.gif?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541664094&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=7ee198ff33b2a42509555e88453bc022\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Why settle for cookware that lets your delicious food stick to the pan because it doesn&rsquo;t have a non-stick coating or a non-stick coating that flakes off into your food? Cooking is easier, faster and more fun when you have the right equipment. We wanted the Blackbeard Armada to be everything you need in the kitchen: frying pans, saucepans, deep casseroles and a lid for the Blackbeard. Non-stick, non-scratch, mirror polished, suitable for all heat sources and made of chef-grade quality. This one-of-a-kind set will be available for a fraction of the price one usually pays for this type of cookware.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/231/094/ff2ab12521c27b0406510475367c0dcd_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1542027255&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=c589d0980cc1d96ebfdbfd9f5a64586d\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/074/408/85873f578c024cd999dba4465bd80a10_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540889264&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=4d22067569b3f0a3c97f242c55935a2b\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/074/428/a4d8fd3f86db55e1b0d6567ac097df8a_original.gif?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540889356&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=f6c7badfabcaf44c807852db219af98f\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/074/440/ccf358e193dd08bfc0403aa9944ec2d3_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540889493&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=29023432d1ceca1e4683b715e6e0ba12\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Crowd Cookware is based upon a community of thousands of food lovers. Together we develop, design and create new chef-grade products that otherwise would only be available to the famous brands we all know.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our first treasure &ndash; the original Blackbeard frying pan &ndash; is coming to town as we speak. We are thrilled! That&rsquo;s why we couldn&rsquo;t wait: we already sailed across the world to surprise some of our backers last spring. We delivered the first Blackbeards in person as a way to say &ldquo;thanks&rdquo; to our crowd. Check out the great response and find out how the Blackbeard arrived at Kickstarter&rsquo;s HQ.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/082/7a14f095330e1a56c736bc44eb3419a5_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541663581&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=3dc6c2cc8280e874fbd3419ba4f3a643\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/223/cd9adabd8d901a39c3fb3bd2cf272298_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541665059&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=3d6a260d8bd9206e69601b62d08a4cad\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Patron-cuisinier chef Johan van Groeninge - Restaurant: Avant-Garde van Groeninge * (One Michelin star)&nbsp;</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/089/781/a9d5b2f49916a3fda75ff9e6cc677857_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540985141&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=b2a2818153cbaa073cfb7be6acffd9a2\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/631/f07e9eb740fb8f79992a8ba39fc113c5_original.gif?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541668027&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=a3f9cc8e07562908283f13ade7125d2e\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/263/215b5ed4ef804c4a58714ba1c6dfef4b_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541665477&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=2331b53a68c86d2c8b5b70a8ee8a114b\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/229/71077ba4b9ac8e14a82ea92c958a0dd3_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541665135&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=70ae00b16a947c7cf5d365060d9b50f3\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/104/621/67fb167e19031185ce6a4e83529c0566_original.gif?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541083857&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=2b6202e76e039f194011cbcd41cbbd94\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Food connects, especially when it&rsquo;s shared with others. Surprise a loved one during Thanksgiving or Christmas with the &lsquo;promise of tomorrow&rsquo;: give away one of our Blackbeard Armada items as a virtual gift and be one of the first to get to know all the adventurous details of the production.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We&rsquo;ve recorded a short video in which you can see me &ndash; Tacco &ndash; and the one who taught me everything about cooking &ndash; my mother. Pre-order one of our fleet essentials and share this video: amaze someone else at the dinner table. Happy holidays!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/235/dded04f7ae0a993b570510cab4fdf283_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541665180&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=d27b603111e10d5e198e67c54a9b362b\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/074/706/83d70a727082c4fa7f24dd1ea3628dfe_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540891060&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=75a7af8d60265c14e247924012038544\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We believe the cookware industry needs pirates. That&rsquo;s how we originally came up with our first hack: the Blackbeard. A unique collaboration between our crowd, Michelin star chefs and manufacturers working for the world&rsquo;s best-known brands.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>High-quality pans usually do not come cheap. A lot of the price is taken up by marketing activities, distribution networks, and local agencies, which mainly focus on brand positioning and do not necessarily reflect the quality of the pan. We are working together with our crowd to create another smuggling route that evades the big brands.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Blackbeard Armada will be manufactured by the same producers as the famous brands we all know. But instead of paying for the big-brand frills, we are only paying for chef-grade manufacturing. This makes the complete Armada fleet available for a fair price.&nbsp;All resources go into the quality of our products: that&rsquo;s why we haven&rsquo;t recruited native speaking actors for our crowdfunding video :).</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/256/b4532bc5364c0a7b456d5bc25947a0cf_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541665416&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=27fa5bfd65a7843cd0820d6f9d77c52d\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/074/749/78ee96de49985cf20a7b8c1796212d9f_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540891303&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=850aece8f6edf276a84b7957fa5fa346\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/391/11312f509e7cf8f54f6ea84cc5d2f735_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541666425&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=4b4d5e7d23baf57a3904f314acd02b07\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The days of sticking food and organizing cookware in the kitchen are over. The Blackbeard Armada is carefully assembled, consisting of chef-grade frying pans, saucepans, deep casseroles and a lid for the Blackbeard frying pan. A complete fleet of stackable cookware; with an eye for design and easily stored due to the compact design. While being optimized for ease of use for cooks of all levels: whether you&rsquo;re an ambitious home cook or a Michelin star chef.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/249/b122ad65a9c973909a86755edf7fa50e_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541665317&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=940d21f6aa7ea88c925fc5aadee4d56a\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/583/60cf8da5d260a0cd709a8c8abcfe985c_original.gif?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541667753&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=f9009fa6dd9e3bb5f1b1ceb5c4b9c05d\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Thanks to the stainless steel honeycomb pattern</strong>&nbsp;that protrudes above the non-stick coating, the Armada pans are scratch-resistant and extremely suitable for intensive use. Forget regular non-stick layers that start to wear out after 1 to 2 years of use &ndash; or even faster, and where the coating layer ends up in your food. The honeycomb pattern extends the lifespan of the current non-stick layers to at least 5 years</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/089/506/3f778c9362d25f14d0ece2a63b921801_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540983208&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=c4f17770ed61d5050f0ba653b1b9ebfc\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/074/838/01d6c977f9037a35511ee82dd0e01068_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540891766&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=29363cb0c5726fd8e4734f6c3969d560\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our quality isn&#39;t just premium: our frying pans, saucepans, deep casseroles and lid can measure up to quality demands of top chefs. The three-layer construction forms the canvas for the honeycomb pattern that is etched into it. The dimples are then filled with a PTFE Whitford non-stick coating that is PFOA-free. We have thoroughly tested our coating and our pans have received a PASS for all tests with excellent test results</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/252/1c0d89e4e01f0dbdee53fa1673cadebc_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541665361&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=6e6de2301de0ce4eacebe43a488ba744\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/214/254/2a3edecbaf99964330ac656bd600d8bf_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541874747&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=f19bcfda55b87ba11944694431cc4800\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/074/882/3b12e6063bd6e13dc24178675eda063b_original.gif?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540892036&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=67018c46b56c3f5dae8dddb1a4492b77\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/231/100/fc5658d04929bd47fc4d31fbc644ed0f_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1542027290&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=6281dd7c87c63a6ddc256d6c823ce1d1\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We have designed the pans with a 2.6 mm thick surface, which consists of three layers: a stainless steel bottom layer, an aluminum layer, and another mirror polished stainless steel layer as a finish. This technique makes the pans suitable for all heat sources and very energy-efficient.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/074/929/d69b9d40b08c26bab06fa80128bb13cc_original.gif?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540892425&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=27f91deb4a3d83a0a3dc27cbfd1961ed\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/074/889/59ffa8fb307edd3dce67893b3dd6eba6_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540892084&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=cecd64cb42d93ed61c04c0c834dce8f0\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/089/580/c818ce1c8f81c3f57b767cdc41acc270_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540983845&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=11bb0914e1737cfed03ecae340ba21ea\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/186/416/e0335c29e0e2df8dc47b5adef5d0f231_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541666519&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=d492cf5b1c726d61a8efd9dc5da1266e\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>When you hold the Blackbeard - a member of the Armada - for the first time, you can feel and see the quality we had in mind. That&rsquo;s exactly what we wanted you to experience again when holding the different cookware essentials of our Blackbeard Armada. The pans are not too light, but certainly not too heavy. The mirror polishing of our pans provides a glorious and ultimate cooking experience. Smile</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/074/968/bc075018834bca222b4f88398eafe475_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540892639&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=8a59980696a7f8ef57db1d42001f6bd5\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/214/187/8bdc3f34b85be381ec35598813c003d9_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541874306&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=2888751a381996bc3d5274d08d16142d\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Early on in our first campaign, many pirates asked us about a lid for the Blackbeard frying pans. It&rsquo;s upon their request that we&rsquo;ve come up with a lid to control heat easily and preserve flavor, while reducing oil splatter at the same time: the Tricorne. A compact and modern mirror polished stainless steel lid that matches the design of the Blackbeard &oslash;28 cm/11&rdquo; frying pan and wok perfectly and can be stored and cleaned easily. The lid also has a steam vent to let steam escape, so the lid doesn&rsquo;t bang around.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Serve your meals in style with the Tricorne: use the lid like a cloche to cover your dish, causing surprise and expectation among your guests.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/104/715/d6db19b7c838b0100cc835a8309e5035_original.gif?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541084445&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=ef877f78329b410583da5b6faf04a091\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/074/997/c61b50c694d566ae8843cd60384488dd_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540892855&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=e3a72e76593c5a81d1967171e5a38ef4\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Top chefs know better than anyone what it takes to create the perfect pan. That&rsquo;s why we took their advice on board and designed several handles for our Blackbeard Armada.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The handles of the Blackbeard frying pans, Queen Anne&rsquo;s saucepans and Concord casseroles are made of solid cast stainless steel. The handles of the frying pans are riveted onto the pans and we&rsquo;ve decided to use the same handles - adjusted in size - for the saucepans. After extensive testing, we made a choice to use welded handles for both the lid and the deep casseroles. Instead of one handle, our deep casseroles have two small handles that perfectly fit the minimalistic design and make the casseroles easy to store.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/230/800/a98346ff42360594b023b4ee8889761d_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1542025076&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=02611ac1c4482ac4067f35c259d06d03\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/075/005/f926480355fabb93bb723331ec1f89f1_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540892951&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=a1aa8bc397aee5c3a9aebd5da9e93166\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you&rsquo;re pan-frying a thick steak, preparing a traditional beef stew or making a delicious gravy: you can prepare the dish of your choice for every occasion and create a chef-grade meal with the Blackbeard Armada cookware.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/231/104/d7401963d589e14511c29b2564d0a635_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1542027320&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=29e7fe83998882f600bbac17732bb43f\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/075/055/a86c93cef159d7a7b9b71f377eec5973_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540893326&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=9abd6690d07ce4c0e485cfdbf8f28438\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The road to perfection took a long time during which we carefully looked at the design process, so that craftsmanship, design, and love for cooking merge seamlessly. Piece by piece we put together our fleet, using the successful techniques of the original Blackbeard. For our first campaign, we tested the prototypes of the Blackbeard extensively within our community until we had the pan that fits perfectly with what our crew of pirates wants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/214/370/122877902ac9792af13223f67af425a7_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541875647&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=14c3f154b5dab9d96cbe344b06dbe6a9\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We rigorously tested prototypes of the Blackbeard with a very wide range of foodies. Among other things, we discovered that stainless steel thickness less than 2mm is suboptimal, but when it&rsquo;s more than 3mm, the frying pan becomes too heavy for convenient handling. We found the perfect thickness to be 2.6mm.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We tested a huge range of handles because the importance of the handle can&rsquo;t be underestimated: it provides control and is closely linked to the pleasure of cooking.&nbsp;We also extensively tested how far the Blackbeard honeycomb coating should reach for maximum effect, leaving an area near the rim untouched.&nbsp;Last but not least: we bent the edge of the Blackbeard, but we finally put it upright. This allows you to pour without worrying about spillage.&nbsp;Both the saucepans and deep casseroles are designed using the successful techniques of the original Blackbeard frying pans, including a 2.6mm three-layer construction, honeycomb pattern and mirror polish.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/075/072/c4fbd13fce7a5a49fcaefc271d107223_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540893506&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=5360e443309bab69b067b73f1fbca287\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>As middlemen of the global cookware industry, we got to know the manufacturers who produce for renowned brands, allowing us to get to know the ins and outs of this industry.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We wanted to turn the tide by working from the inside, so we signed a partnership with a top-notch manufacturer. A rebellious &lsquo;pan-whisperer&rsquo; who, like no other, is acquainted with all techniques and knows everything about creating the best pans, and has been doing so for many years for the world&rsquo;s best-known brands. As the youngest member of a pans bakers&rsquo; guild, he wanted to break through the monopoly that generations before had adhered to.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/075/081/723f62c0a83304dfd8e9e115ee193061_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540893592&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=cfd70867e1d3473928a50ace9644d654\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking back at our previous campaign, together we can literally do anything. Especially since more cookware manufacturers want to join us. Rather than having a rack filled with scratched, un-coated and excessive kitchen utensils, owning a few will give you the flexibility and the performance to cook whatever you want - even improving your cooking skills</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/075/096/a45f7c4306acd62d9e8f6a7eb15eadf6_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540893686&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=d1f8f52822fdddc277d1e1da40b39625\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/075/100/f22100eb1f094a75e7192fdf8b97c974_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540893724&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=f60db692b3ccc20d537ace88bf20821a\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Are you ready for a life of adventures and never-ending fun? The call of the sea is in the heart of every pirate who ever swashed a buckle. Become part of our community by kick-starting our Blackbeard Armada. Join us and pre-order unique kitchen utensils to complete your own fleet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/104/815/f06800b5a8412ba2cb284b3582ca5a23_original.gif?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1541084959&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=14670ed731bf918f941ba83b8ed27037\" /></p>',289.9,NULL,9977,NULL,12,'1',407,'a:1:{i:0;s:3:\"408\";}','269','249','249','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',29,NULL,NULL,0,60,2,35,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-28 00:17:59','2018-12-21 04:01:07'),(123,19,13,'Bourbon Barrel Bar B Que Sauce','bourbon-barrel-bar-b-que-sauce','Awesome Organic Style  Bar B Que Sauce',NULL,9.85,NULL,968,NULL,20,'1',415,'a:0:{}','5','3.5','6.5','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',38,NULL,NULL,0,60,2,35,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-28 03:16:03','2018-12-12 03:18:36'),(124,25,15,'Hand Carved Duck','hand-carved-duck','Hand Carved Duck','<p>Hand Carved Wooden Duck</p>',75,NULL,9963,NULL,3,'1',418,'a:0:{}','12','8','8','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',43,NULL,NULL,0,70,2,25,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-28 06:09:27','2018-11-28 06:10:27'),(125,9,4,'LUMIÈRE VELVET SMOOTH CHANEL FOUNDATION','lumi-re-velvet-smooth-chanel-foundation','','<p>Perfect for normal and combination to oily skin</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Perfect Skin Affinity complex acts in perfect affinity with the skin to maintain hold and radiance all day long.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>How to use : Apply PERFECTION LUMI&Egrave;RE VELVET after your daily skincare product, without using a sponge or brush. Blend in with fingertips, from the center of the face outwards. Adjust the makeup result by dabbing more onto specific areas of the face. Can also be used as a concealer by dabbing onto areas with blemishes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of item color, it may be slightly different from each monitor display and specification.</p>',120,NULL,0,NULL,0.8,'1',419,'a:0:{}','10','19','10','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',0,NULL,14,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-28 10:17:10','2019-01-24 12:17:58'),(126,9,4,'Chanel Plum Cosmetic PU Makeup Case/Bag','chanel-plum-cosmetic-pu-makeup-case-bag','','<p>A brand-new, unused, unopened, undamaged item graceful for party and outdoor events.</p>',13,NULL,0,NULL,15,'1',420,'a:0:{}','5','19','5','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',0,NULL,15,0,53,2,42,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-11-28 11:02:09','2019-01-24 13:35:37'),(127,21,12,'Stainless Steel Steamer Cookware','stainless-steel-steamer-cookware','Stainless Steel Steamer Cookware Multi-functional Three Layers.','<p><strong>Product Description:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>More durable than traditional pots for a lifetime of use; stainless-steel lid; stainless-steel handles permanently secured with stainless-steel rivets.&nbsp;</p>',20,NULL,9992,NULL,3,'1',427,'a:3:{i:0;s:3:\"428\";i:1;s:3:\"429\";i:2;s:3:\"430\";}','32','28','30','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',14,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-03 06:12:51','2018-12-03 06:38:39'),(128,21,12,'Single Pot Non-stick Picnic Cookware','single-pot-non-stick-picnic-cookware','Non-stick design, portable with a mesh bag for convenient storage and carrying.','<p><strong>Product Description:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Perfect for camping, backpacking, hiking, emergency preparedness, or as part of a survival kit, scratch and corrosion resistant and good thermal conductivity.<br />\r\nHard oxidation treatment aluminium alloy. Heat-resistant , strong and durable<br />\r\nFolding handles for space saving and compactness<br />\r\nEasy to carry and convenient to use<br />\r\nScratch and corrosion resistant<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',20,NULL,9993,NULL,450,'1',431,'a:2:{i:0;s:3:\"432\";i:1;s:3:\"433\";}','19.11','20','14','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',13,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-03 06:25:24','2018-12-03 06:37:42'),(129,21,12,'Stainless Steel 2-Quart Saucepan','stainless-steel-2-quart-saucepan','Premium cookware that features professional triple-ply construction, a core of pure aluminum bonded to a stainless steel interior and a brushed stainless exterior. Heat Surround technology maintains even heat distribution along the bottom and side walls of the cookware, eliminating hotspots.','<p>Product Description:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Inspired by the great French kitchens, Cuisinart began making professional cookware almost 30 years ago. Constructed of the finest materials available to perfectly perform all of the classic cooking techniques, Cuisinart cookware continues a long tradition of excellence. Cuisinart&#39;s commitment to quality and innovation continues with the MultiClad Pro Stainless cookware, designed to meet the demands of gourmet chefs everywhere. Unique triple-ply construction joins a brushed stainless steel exterior, a pure aluminum core that provides even heat distribution, and a stainless steel interior, for optimal performance. MultiClad Pro Stainless lets you celebrate the fine art of cooking.</p>',34.11,NULL,0,NULL,1701,'1',434,'a:1:{i:0;s:3:\"435\";}','39','21','13','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',6,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-03 06:34:25','2018-12-03 06:39:18'),(130,14,8,'gold earings new','gold-earings-new','Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries','<p><strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong>&nbsp;is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry&#39;s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries</p>',20,NULL,0,'2555',5,'1',436,NULL,'5','5','5','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',6,NULL,NULL,0,51,2,44,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-03 07:05:18','2018-12-03 07:05:18'),(131,40,17,'2017 Korean New Dresses Slim Long Sleeve','2017-korean-new-dresses-slim-long-sleeve','','<p>Item color displayed in photos may be showing slightly different on your computer monitor since monitors are not calibrated same. &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1inch=2.54cm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dress size table</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; border-color:black; vertical-align:top\">\r\n			<p><strong>Size(cm)</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=