LL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-12 02:06:21','2018-12-12 02:06:21'),(149,37,16,'Mood Mugs ceramic thermal','mood-mugs-ceramic-thermal','Mood Mugs ceramic thermal insulated mugs with faces by THABTO','<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mood Mugs ceramic thermal insulated mugs with faces by THABTO</p>',25,NULL,270,NULL,0.63,'1',476,NULL,'50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',36,NULL,NULL,0,59,2,36,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-12 02:08:11','2018-12-12 02:08:11'),(150,42,19,'Classic Stainless Steel Cookware','classic-stainless-steel-cookware','Impact-bonded aluminum bases provide fast, even heating. Safe for the stove, oven, broiler, and dishwasher.','<ul>\r\n	<li>Long, ergonomic handles provide a secure grip even with full, heavy pans, stay cool even when pan is hot, and are double-riveted by hand.</li>\r\n	<li>Fill lines make measuring easy, and covers have straining holes that line up with pour spouts to drain liquids without having to use a separate colander.</li>\r\n	<li>High sides and narrow opening minimize evaporation during slow process of stock- and soup-making. Heavy-gauge sloped bottom heats evenly makes stirring easier.</li>\r\n</ul>',39.99,NULL,998,NULL,2.1,'1',499,'a:2:{i:0;s:3:\"500\";i:1;s:3:\"501\";}','11.65','6.38','6.26','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',8,NULL,NULL,0,60,2,35,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-12 10:20:58','2018-12-12 11:08:51'),(151,17,9,'Golden Ring','golden-ring','','<p><a href=\"https://www.debeers.com/db-classic-yellow-gold-solitaire-ring-j1ex01by\" target=\"_blank\">DB Classic Yellow Gold Solitaire En</a></p>',120,NULL,248,'32323',0.8,'1',502,'a:0:{}','1','1','1','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',44,NULL,6,0,51,2,44,'all','',NULL,1,0,'2018-12-12 11:41:42','2019-07-30 06:11:02'),(152,26,29,'Organic Seasoning','organic-seasoning','All Organic Ingredients. These Spices and Seasonings are purchased from all over the World. The best of the best only get used in our Products at Pure Leaf.',NULL,359,NULL,190,NULL,0.5,'1',505,NULL,'4','1.2','4','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',16,NULL,NULL,0,70,2,25,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-13 01:19:03','2018-12-13 01:19:03'),(153,42,19,'Stainless Steel Cookware, 6-quart','stainless-steel-cookware-6-quart','Made from brushed stainless steel with an impact-bonded aluminum base for fast and even heating, the  Classic Stainless Steel 6-Quart Covered Stock Pot is durably constructed for reliable everyday performance.','<p>&nbsp;Ideal for stews, stock, and chili, this stock pot lets you slowly simmer your favorite recipes, and also gives you plenty of room to boil water for pasta, shellfish, potatoes, and more. Convenient measuring marks, a straining cover, and pour spouts help you save time in the kitchen. The Calphalon Classic Stainless Steel 6-Quart Covered Stock Pot is oven and broiler safe, dishwasher safe for easy cleaning, and backed by a full lifetime warranty.</p>',53.99,NULL,1000,NULL,2.5,'1',506,'a:2:{i:0;i:507;i:1;i:508;}','12.56','12.25','7.95','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',6,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-13 03:00:33','2018-12-13 03:00:33'),(154,40,17,'Unicorn Birthday Party Decorations','unicorn-birthday-party-decorations','Unicorn Birthday Party Decorations | Watercolor Floral Unicorn | Unicorn Party Decor','<p>Unicorn Birthday Party Decorations | Watercolor Floral Unicorn | Unicorn Party Decor</p>',45,NULL,493,NULL,0.63,'1',510,NULL,'50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',13,NULL,NULL,0,51,2,44,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-13 03:23:41','2018-12-13 03:23:41'),(155,42,19,'Cookware Stockpot','cookware-stockpot','Features high sides that slow the evaporation of liquids, providing the ideal design for creating a variety of stocks. The wide bottom of the pan allows for sauteing of ingredients before the addition of liquids for delicious soups and stews.','<ul>\r\n	<li>Flared edges for drip-free pouring; metal-utensil safe; capacity etched on base; flat stainless-steel lids trap in heat and moisture.</li>\r\n	<li>Well-suited for canning, blanching, and preparing food in large quantities features a thick, conductive aluminum core and a high-performing stainless-steel cooking surface, which work together to quickly and evenly heat for exceptional cooking performance.</li>\r\n	<li>Three-ply construction of thick, conductive aluminum with a hard-anodized exterior bonded to a stainless-steel interior helps to distribute heat quickly and evenly.</li>\r\n</ul>',329.95,NULL,1000,NULL,5.9,'1',511,'a:1:{i:0;i:512;}','15.5','11.4','5.5','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',6,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-13 03:28:55','2018-12-13 03:28:55'),(156,42,19,'3Qt Cookware Saucepan','3qt-cookware-saucepan','3-quart sauce pan is a versatile essential found in a variety of sizes in every well- equipped kitchen. With high, straight sides and a smaller surface area, the sauce pan holds heat well and limits evaporation.','<p>Can be used with or without its lid to control evaporation. Combines the unsurpassed quality with a refined sense of style, making it a popular choice for any kitchen. Features a thick, conductive aluminum core and a high-performing stainless-steel cooking surface, which work together to quickly and evenly distribute heat for exceptional cooking performance. The hard-anodized exterior of cookware offers the durability of a scratch-resistant surface, while also adding contrasting visual appeal when paired with the stainless interior.&nbsp;</p>',219.75,NULL,997,NULL,3.5,'1',513,'a:1:{i:0;i:514;}','16.3','8.8','3.9','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',9,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-13 03:52:36','2018-12-13 03:52:36'),(157,42,19,'Curtain String Light Wedding Party','curtain-string-light-wedding-party','Perfect decoration: Waterproof perfect for indoor and outdoor decorations. Christmas, Valentine\'s Day, wedding, home, window, bathroom, festival, Holiday, shows, restaurant, hotel, commercial building, shopping center etc.','<p>Made from 300 bright WHITE LED lights, the source of light is LED lights, which disperses light very well and provides powerful light.</p>',17.99,NULL,992,NULL,1.25,'1',515,'a:2:{i:0;i:516;i:1;i:517;}','8.3','3.1','4','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',14,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-13 04:35:02','2018-12-13 04:35:02'),(158,42,19,'Spandex Chair Covers Wedding Universal','spandex-chair-covers-wedding-universal','Stretchy & Universal: Our chair covers can be fitted most of chairs (without Armrest) including Dining Room Chairs, Stacking Chairs, Banquet Chairs,Folding Chairs.','<ul>\r\n	<li>The chair cover material is 90% polyester and 10% spandex, it&#39;s good elasticity, wrinkle resist, durable.</li>\r\n	<li>Hemmed the edges and good stitching with surged inside edges.</li>\r\n	<li>Used for all kinds of occasion, like wedding,anniversary,birthday,mother&#39;s day party etc.</li>\r\n	<li>Convenient for install and care.</li>\r\n</ul>',215.98,NULL,9992,NULL,45,'1',518,'a:3:{i:0;i:519;i:1;i:520;i:2;i:521;}','28.5','15.6','13.2','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',14,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-13 05:05:43','2018-12-13 05:05:43'),(159,26,29,'Organic Sauces','organic-sauces','',NULL,595,NULL,959,NULL,5.5,'1',522,NULL,'5','3.5','7.0','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',47,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-13 05:55:30','2018-12-13 05:55:30'),(160,26,29,'Pure Leaf Premium DogFood','pure-leaf-premium-dogfood','',NULL,9.85,NULL,187,'2000yut79osh',10,'1',523,'a:1:{i:0;i:524;}','26','16','28','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',19,NULL,NULL,0,60,2,35,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-14 01:14:16','2018-12-14 01:14:16'),(161,40,17,'Arts & Crafts Stores in KL & Selangor','arts-crafts-stores-in-kl-selangor','','<p>Arts &amp; Crafts Stores in KL &amp; Selangor</p>',125,NULL,16,NULL,0.63,'1',525,NULL,'50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',16,NULL,NULL,0,51,2,44,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-14 03:05:29','2018-12-14 03:05:29'),(162,16,18,'Michael Kors Women\'s Parker Rose Gold-Tone Stainless Steel Watch','michael-kors-women-s-parker-rose-gold-tone-stainless-steel-watch','','<p>Steel case, Stainless steel and acetate bracelet, Blush dial, Quartz movement, Scratch resistant mineral, Water resistant up to 5 ATM - 50 merters - 165 feet Michael Kors Women&#39;s Parker Rose Gold-Tone Stainless Steel Bracelet Watch.</p>',150,NULL,0,NULL,0.8,'1',528,'a:0:{}','22','22','11','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',6,NULL,8,0,60,2,35,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2018-12-14 11:10:18','2019-02-13 12:51:18'),(163,16,18,'Michael Kors Women\'s Blair Watch Quartz Mineral Crystal MK5613','michael-kors-women-s-blair-watch-quartz-mineral-crystal-mk5613','','<p>Product Description Michael Kors Women&#39;s Blair Stainless steel case, Stainless steel bracelet, Rose Gold dial, Quartz movement, Scratch resistant mineral, Water resistant up to 10 ATM - 100 Meters - 330 Feet.</p>',142,NULL,0,NULL,21,'1',529,'a:0:{}','11','22','11','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',6,NULL,8,0,65,2,30,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2018-12-14 11:32:04','2019-02-13 13:28:21'),(164,40,17,'Non stick Non scratch Frying Pan','non-stick-non-scratch-frying-pan','','<p>Why settle for a pan that burns your delicious food because it doesn&rsquo;t have a non-stick coating, or a non-stick coating that is flaking off into your food?&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We set out to design the essential frying pan, because we believe quality cookware is at the heart of any great meal. In The Blackbeard, we saw an opportunity to create a next generation frying pan, implementing a new non-stick, non-scratch coating, on top of multiple layers of stainless steel.&nbsp;In the middle there is an aluminum core that evenly distributes the heat over the entire pan. This makes the Blackbeard suitable for all heat sources, including induction.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We wanted The Blackbeard to be effective without compromise, and at the same time inspirational: its sleek and minimalist design should invite cooks of all levels into the kitchen to create something great.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"C:\\Users\\admin\\Downloads\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"CR-OV-SOCIAL-Appliances-Cookware-v2-7-17\" />And there they blow. The first pan of our Crowd Cookware fleet is the Blackbeard: the Blackbeard &empty;24 cm, &empty;28 cm and &empty; 28 cm wok with a new generation of non-stick coatings. Quality pans directly from the same factory that manufactures for many top brands. But now for the real price.</p>',332,NULL,50,NULL,0.63,'1',530,'a:2:{i:0;i:531;i:1;i:532;}','50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',6,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-17 02:48:47','2018-12-17 02:48:47'),(165,40,17,'A Plastic-free, Fuss-free lunch box.','a-plastic-free-fuss-free-lunch-box','','<p><img alt=\"An eco-friendly, portion separated lunch box with  a stainless steel, easy-clean, flip top design.\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/366/830/e247916130c3efdf729da20cb82d6df8_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1543009473&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=bec82c3b6be82bb46f3ce660727a5dd2\" style=\"height:750px; width:500px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now this was before the media frenzy around plastic pollution. #banthebag wasn&#39;t even a thing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Back then I was a ziplock-bag-using, cling-wrap-loving, freezer-bag-fiend.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But deep down I knew&nbsp;<strong>something was wrong</strong>. And the schools progressive no-plastic policy became my&nbsp;<strong>impetus for change</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So I went on a&nbsp;<strong>long and</strong>&nbsp;<strong>expensive</strong>&nbsp;(and cupboard-cluttering) journey to find the&nbsp;<strong>perfect solution</strong>&nbsp;for a plastic-free lunch box that&nbsp;<strong>ticked all the boxes</strong>. And it wasn&#39;t easy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Long story short,&nbsp;<strong>I saw the need for a no-fuss, plastic free lunchbox</strong>&nbsp;that could&nbsp;<strong>keep my son&#39;s foods separated</strong>.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/366/844/83576b8a53bb2f3c19ebf2aa6f7194ff_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1543009541&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=ef6d0cfe694fbfd386a8a8969796e4bc\" style=\"height:350px; width:500px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now Archie, even I can admit, is&nbsp;<strong>a&nbsp;</strong><strong>bit of a fusspot</strong>. If I think his carrots are allowed to rub up against some hummus, I&#39;ve got another thing coming.&nbsp;(sorry Archie if you ever read this!)</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>So I went on a journey to solve the problem</strong>&nbsp;and launched my solution via KickStarter back in 2017 with the&nbsp;<strong>Seed &amp; Sprout Stacker</strong>, a stainless steel bento-style lunch box. We were&nbsp;<strong>fully funded in 48 hours</strong>&nbsp;(THANK YOU!!!) and have since sold the Stacker to thousands of families across the globe, as well as&nbsp;<strong>planted a tree for every lunch box sold</strong>. Thats a LOT of trees!&nbsp;</p>',150,NULL,76,NULL,0.63,'1',533,'a:1:{i:0;i:534;}','50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',30,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,1,0,'2018-12-17 02:56:01','2018-12-17 02:56:01'),(166,40,17,'Bi-Grip the best suit for playing hard','bi-grip-the-best-suit-for-playing-hard','','<p>Bi-Grip is a new standard of excellence in the thumbsticks world, giving you more room to fine-tune aim increasing accuracy and control.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks to the tests against our competitors we believe that Bi-Grip is the best fit in the market. We developed Bi-Grip not only by focusing on our competitors, but by examining how to take over the wear issue and improve the way to play.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>WHAT IS A Bi-Grip THUMBSTICK?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bi-Grip is the unique thumbstick that can be settle on a smashed analog stick and turns out new along regenerating old lever sticks which have worn down. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A protection device for protecting a control lever, in particular in a game console. The control lever having a rod and a head with an enlarged end, compromises an attachment element arranged for attaching the protection device to the head, a contact portion arranged for being touched by finger of a user during use of the control lever. Patented since 2018.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',253,NULL,74,NULL,0.63,'1',535,'a:1:{i:0;i:536;}','50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',32,NULL,NULL,0,51,2,44,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-17 03:09:08','2018-12-17 03:09:08'),(167,40,17,'Electric Eel Wheel Mini 2','electric-eel-wheel-mini-2','','<p>The Electric Eel Wheel Mini 2 is an affordable spinning wheel in a travel-friendly package. &nbsp;Its smooth operation will help you spin gorgeous yarn.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Where can you spin?</h1>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>In your comfy chair at home</li>\r\n	<li>At work during your lunch break</li>\r\n	<li>While binge watching your favorite show</li>\r\n	<li>With your knitting group</li>\r\n	<li>At a fiber retreat</li>\r\n	<li>In the park</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h1>Stretch Goals</h1>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>(INCLUDED) $150K - Add a spin card</li>\r\n	<li>(INCLUDED) $200K - Add second color option for the Electric Eel Wheel Mini 2</li>\r\n	<li>(INCLUDED) $250K - Add a spare drive belt and tension band</li>\r\n	<li>(INCLUDED) $400K - Add a third color option for just the bobbin</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h1>Good for New and Experienced Spinners</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>This design is great for people learning to spin because it is easy to use and is the least expensive spinning wheel available these days. &nbsp;This means you can learn to spin quickly without spending a fortune. &nbsp;Many people find the Mini has everything they need in a spinning wheel.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mini users have found that it is exceptionally well suited to use during travel or for teaching children to spin. &nbsp;Many experienced spinners report using the Mini for spinning in places they never could before, and some have completely switched over to the Mini for all their spinning.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/026/818/8b03b3c95666de565199c6fc0594ab59_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540489132&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=bd9834c8ce48e64ffed0fb13723f3094\" style=\"height:330px; width:680px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the first things you might notice about the Mini 2 is its beautiful and stunning open design which serves an important purpose during spinning. &nbsp;It allows the spinner to see the yarn being wound onto the bobbin from all angles. This was one of the features the beta testers really loved about the new Mini.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I&#39;d like to give a special thanks Caitlin Youngquist, an industrial designer, who volunteered her time and efforts to make this design possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Quieter Design</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>This new design is much quieter, thanks in large part to the addition of ball bearings which reduce friction and vibration on each end of the flyer. &nbsp;The much lower sound level of the Mini 2 makes it a joy to use when you&#39;re out with friends or spinning in public places.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Thoughtful Design</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;Many useful features have been added to the new design:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>A switch to change the direction of the flyer. There are three positions: clockwise, off, and counterclockwise.</li>\r\n	<li>Slotted holes in the flat bottom allow screw or clamp mounting options.</li>\r\n	<li>Roving slots hold your roving so your singles don&#39;t untwist between spinning sessions.</li>\r\n	<li>Magnetic orifice hook holder to help prevent lost orifice hooks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/026/917/e1b4564751d33719ee36e81a31ac6035_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540489763&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=23d9eef1e40e2bc13b572bb3384a8343\" style=\"height:284px; width:680px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Included Items</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Electric Eel Wheel Mini 2</strong>&nbsp;is the base unit. &nbsp;This lets you spin the fiber into yarn. &nbsp;A standard power supply and orifice hook is included with the base unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Bobbins</strong>&nbsp;store the yarn you spin. &nbsp;Each bobbin holds over one ounce (30 grams) of yarn. &nbsp;The beta testers are fitting 1.4 to 2 ounces on a bobbin, but it could be less if you&#39;re spinning bulky yarn.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Optional Items</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>USB Power Cord</strong>&nbsp;lets you spin from a USB battery pack. &nbsp;There is a section below that explains this in more detail.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Orifice Reducer</strong>&nbsp;is plug that goes into the front of the flyer, which helps reduce the wobble when spinning thin singles. &nbsp;Some spinners really like feature. &nbsp;However, others don&#39;t care to use it, so it&#39;s a personal preference as to whether you want to use it or not.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/026/395/03bef33d683444749a72ee5b4299a9c3_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1540487149&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=8508f87a3c2f76de6009310aa9144574\" style=\"height:490px; width:680px\" /></p>',123,NULL,395,NULL,0.63,'1',538,NULL,'50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',11,NULL,NULL,0,51,2,44,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-17 03:18:25','2018-12-17 03:18:25'),(168,44,30,'Laptop','laptop','','<p>Windows 10</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Intel core 7th Gen</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8GB of Ram</p>\r\n\r\n<p>500 GB Memory</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',800,NULL,0,'1526783892',3.5,'1',539,NULL,'24','20','15','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,'1',6,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2018-12-17 03:42:07','2018-12-17 03:42:07'),(169,17,9,'Gold neckless variable','gold-neckless-variable','',NULL,12,NULL,0,NULL,1,'1',541,'a:0:{}','1','1','1','var