piece offers a varied degree of support corresponding with gender and weight for enhanced flexibility.&nbsp;</p>',74.95,NULL,0,NULL,0.1,'1',574,'a:1:{i:0;s:3:\"575\";}','5','5','0.7','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-07 01:06:58','2019-01-07 01:20:48'),(191,42,19,'New Balance Men\'s 990v4','new-balance-men-s-990v4','','<ul>\r\n	<li>100% Leather and Textile</li>\r\n	<li>Made in the USA</li>\r\n	<li>Rubber sole</li>\r\n	<li>Shaft measures approximately low-top from arch</li>\r\n	<li>Lace-up running shoe featuring breathable-mesh upper with supportive-leather overlays</li>\r\n	<li>Blown rubber outsole. Dual-density collar foam</li>\r\n	<li>ENCAP PU ring with EVA core in heel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />',101,NULL,3,NULL,0.1,'1',576,'a:1:{i:0;i:577;}','14','9','6','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-07 01:19:36','2019-01-07 01:19:36'),(192,40,17,'Hive Explorer | Smart Insect Farm for Upcycling Food Waste','hive-explorer-smart-insect-farm-for-upcycling-food-waste','','<h1>Hive Explorer is a portable, smart insect farm and micro-ecosystem for mealworms with educational value.</h1>\r\n\r\n<h1>It empowers you to recycle your food waste into fertilizer and proteins!&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/447/197/b854466857ed3bc632cae2d040e9a6c6_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1543759751&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=14b2cd4672c824179a346fda69191522\" style=\"height:453px; width:680px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h1>It inspires to recycle effectively and build a sustainable ecosystem. The beautiful workbook enables exploration into topics ranging from metamorphosis and insect farming to the position of insects in the ecosystem, and many more.&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/626/449/627a4415d09889afe344fdaf6c05e3d4_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1545607364&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=0e60fef86fe186395d15378947c22a33\" style=\"height:440px; width:680px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Food Waste accounts for 8% of global warming!&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Food Waste should be avoided in the first place. But the food that is unavoidably wasted is currently either composted or put into landfills. This costs money, energy and lots of other resources!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/270/260/454bf1e0e3d4b0b509066d615780d32a_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1542252617&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=ec20c662108fcc7b8c4af9db78399c69\" style=\"height:600px; width:680px\" /></p>',62287,NULL,390,NULL,0.63,'1',578,NULL,'50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,0,51,2,44,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-07 02:44:57','2019-01-07 02:44:57'),(193,40,17,'The Smart Indoor Garden','the-smart-indoor-garden','','<p>aspara&trade; is a hydroponic smart grower that helps you grow fresh and healthy-to-eat vegetables and herbs right on your kitchen countertop.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Using a combination of LED grow lights, an automatic watering system and advanced sensors, aspara&trade; is a connected control system for your indoor garden that does the growing for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/433/041/ffe1b4691a4808239836f42359a2fae5_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1543597695&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=9737fd447b3a3301fd84e42457c731d2\" style=\"height:454px; width:680px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>While organic farming has been put more into practice than ever, when receiving food from an outside source, it&rsquo;s truly hard to say what&rsquo;s in your food.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Even if pesticides aren&rsquo;t used, vegetables can still be contaminated in other ways, such as by heavy metals that occur naturally in soil.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>However, starting a garden at home, and growing vegetables successfully, is not an easy task. Most homes are limited by lack of space or don&rsquo;t have the best environment for growing plants. And for some, growing plants from a seed can seem like a daunting task.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/433/059/ec432bdb922f38564caf7fd75eff2632_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1543597814&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=6e411651d154ac7fac69a969132eb0c7\" style=\"height:454px; width:680px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>aspara&trade;&rsquo;s smart built-in sensors monitor, detect, report and record growth conditions based on nutrient concentration, air temperature, humidity, water temperature and overall water content in the system.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The sensors will adjust lighting, water flow and planting modes based on your plant&rsquo;s needs. Precise monitoring of the growth conditions provides accurate instruction on the amount of water and nutrients required to be refilled into the system.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/464/832/173ab68d6dc6cbe0819ada5f16505cf6_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1543904885&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=747592f317e6edee96f626f130a6ef6c\" style=\"height:454px; width:680px\" /></p>',59948,NULL,298,NULL,0.63,'1',579,NULL,'50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,0,58,2,37,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-07 03:01:48','2019-01-07 03:01:48'),(194,52,33,'Sauvage Eau de parfum','sauvage-eau-de-parfum','','<p>The powerful freshness of Sauvage exudes new sensual and mysterious facets, amply renewing itself with the signature of an ingenious composition. Calabrian bergamot, as juicy and spirited as ever, invites new spicy notes to add fullness and sensuality, as the woody ambery trail of Ambroxan&reg; is wrapped in the smoky accents of Papua New Guinean vanilla absolute for greater masculinity. Fran&ccedil;ois Demachy, Dior Perfumer-Creator, drew inspiration from the desert in the magical hour of twilight. Mixed with the coolness of the night, the burning desert air exudes profound fragrances. In the hour when the wolves come out and the sky is set ablaze, a new magic unfolds.</p>',92,NULL,7,NULL,1,'1',580,NULL,'24','12','12','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,23,NULL,NULL,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-07 04:00:28','2019-01-07 04:00:28'),(195,10,34,'Leather In Brown Texture with ancient','leather-in-brown-texture-with-ancient','','<p>This docking station is compatible with all cell phones including iPhone 6 plus, iPhone 6, iPhone 5, iPhone 4, e all Android phones, moreover it&#39;s compatible with iPad and all kinds of tablet.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Item shown is as WALNUT color<br />\r\n<br />\r\n8 different colors are available for this item:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Cherry<br />\r\n- Mahogany<br />\r\n- Neutral ( Beech )<br />\r\n- Ebony<br />\r\n- Teak<br />\r\n- Rosewood<br />\r\n- Walnut<br />\r\n- Slate grey<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis docking station is a great solution to keep all your daily items organized and easy to find. It was designed to keep your smartphone, your tablet, keys, watch, glasses, wallet, everything is organized in a series of spaces specifically designed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n---ENGRAVED PERSONALIZED TEXT :---<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo require your engraved personalized text:&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Choose &quot;YES &quot; in the personalized box option<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-write your text in the note box of your order during the checkout process.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- The text will be engraved onto your docking station&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Please keep in mind that I do not correct your text, I will only copy and paste it. So you have to be sure that it&#39;s entirely correct.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- The engraved text has a good quality and visibility with any colors.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n--- PRODUCT DETAILS ---<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis docking station is composed by 2 interlocking plywood bars each of 7,5 x 7,5 inches (19 x 19 cm). The assembly of this item is really easy, so tools or skills are not required to mount it.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>',50,NULL,97,NULL,4,'1',582,NULL,'55','55','55','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,3,NULL,7,0,70,2,25,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-14 11:15:35','2019-01-14 11:15:35'),(196,10,34,'Best Shine Button Down Men Shirt','best-shine-button-down-men-shirt','','<p>This docking station is compatible with all cell phones including iPhone 6 plus, iPhone 6, iPhone 5, iPhone 4, e all Android phones, moreover it&#39;s compatible with iPad and all kinds of tablet.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Item shown is as WALNUT color<br />\r\n<br />\r\n8 different colors are available for this item:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Cherry<br />\r\n- Mahogany<br />\r\n- Neutral ( Beech )<br />\r\n- Ebony<br />\r\n- Teak<br />\r\n- Rosewood<br />\r\n- Walnut<br />\r\n- Slate grey<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis docking station is a great solution to keep all your daily items organized and easy to find. It was designed to keep your smartphone, your tablet, keys, watch, glasses, wallet, everything is organized in a series of spaces specifically designed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n---ENGRAVED PERSONALIZED TEXT :---<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo require your engraved personalized text:&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Choose &quot;YES &quot; in the personalized box option<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-write your text in the note box of your order during the checkout process.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- The text will be engraved onto your docking station&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Please keep in mind that I do not correct your text, I will only copy and paste it. So you have to be sure that it&#39;s entirely correct.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- The engraved text has a good quality and visibility with any colors.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n--- PRODUCT DETAILS ---<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis docking station is composed by 2 interlocking plywood bars each of 7,5 x 7,5 inches (19 x 19 cm). The assembly of this item is really easy, so tools or skills are not required to mount it.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>',15,NULL,0,'333',2,'1',583,NULL,'55','55','55','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,7,0,60,2,35,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-14 11:27:38','2019-01-14 11:27:38'),(197,16,18,'Michael Kors heritage rose gold tone silver tone stud cuff bracelet','michael-kors-heritage-rose-gold-tone-silver-tone-stud-cuff-bracelet','','<p>This is a brand new Michael Kors gold tone stainless steel slip-on cuff bracelet decorated with nine silver tone Astor studs. Note on the backside of cuff the imprint of MICHAEL KORS and a single dainty crystal to the side. Inner diameter is approximately 2.25. Michael Kors brown drawstring pouch and pamphlet included as shown in picture. This beautifully designed cuff bracelet will give just the right modern pop to your outfit</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Michael Kors MKJ3612791 Women&#39;s Heritage Astor Rose Gold Tone Stainless Steel Bracelet</p>',40,NULL,28,NULL,70,'1',585,'a:1:{i:0;s:3:\"586\";}','5','3','1','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,32,NULL,13,0,70,2,25,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2019-01-15 12:24:52','2019-06-10 11:55:19'),(198,10,34,'Cricket Batting Kit','cricket-batting-kit','',NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,55,'1',587,'a:0:{}','55','55','55','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,7,0,62,2,33,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-17 09:56:42','2019-01-17 10:29:45'),(199,9,4,'Chanel maroon Scarf','chanel-maroon-scarf','','<p>Its a ver wearable scarf for everday use to formal wears, You can pair them differently</p>',40,NULL,0,NULL,10,'1',588,'a:2:{i:0;s:3:\"589\";i:1;s:3:\"590\";}','20','19','25','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,10,0,70,2,25,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2019-01-21 11:59:08','2021-07-13 11:56:32'),(200,40,17,'PYRA:M Two Movements in One Smart Luxury Timepiece','pyra-m-two-movements-in-one-smart-luxury-timepiece','','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/839/393/0acd223dfdb05846150b4fb3630cd3f6_original.JPG?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1548004541&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=5ed4292fd09130851db537d501b3fb45\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/838/785/aef72ed4e63d40037e301b7390cbff45_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1548000265&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=2ccce82c936a4a27e24cc8f23c805c78\" /></p>',2641,NULL,289,NULL,0.63,'1',591,NULL,'50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,11,NULL,16,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 03:42:40','2019-01-23 03:42:40'),(201,42,19,'Multi-Use Programmable Pressure Cooker','multi-use-programmable-pressure-cooker','','<ul>\r\n	<li>Healthy, stainless steel (18/8) inner cooking pot made from food grade 304, no chemical coating, 3-ply bottom for even heat distribution, fully sealed environment traps the flavours, nutrients and aromas within the food</li>\r\n	<li>Built with the latest 3rd generation technology, the microprocessor monitors pressure, temperature, keeps time, and adjusts heating intensity and duration to achieve your desired results every time.</li>\r\n	<li>Features 14 Smart Programs - Soup, Meat/Stew, Bean/Chili, Poultry, Saut&eacute;/Simmer, Rice, Multigrain, Porridge, Steam, Slow Cook, Keep Warm, Yogurt, Manual, and Pressure Cook. Now, your favorite dishes are as easy as pressing a button</li>\r\n</ul>',98,NULL,6,NULL,11.8,'1',592,'a:2:{i:0;i:593;i:1;i:594;}','14.17','14.84','13.31','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,NULL,17,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 03:50:25','2019-01-23 03:50:25'),(202,42,19,'Magic Bullet Blender','magic-bullet-blender','','<p>Unique extraction blades and exclusive cyclonic action to break down, pulverize, and emulsify whole fruits and vegetables better than any standard blender or juicer, creating silky-smooth nutrient-extracted beverages that nourish your system from the inside out. Great for those who are active in their lives and proactive about their health</p>',35,NULL,10,NULL,4.7,'1',595,'a:2:{i:0;i:596;i:1;i:597;}','12','77','15.9','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,18,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 03:56:25','2019-01-23 03:56:25'),(203,42,19,'The Vanaheim Professional Blender','the-vanaheim-professional-blender','','<p>The Vanaheim Professional Blender features smart and sleek design, coming with outstanding performance 2.25HP of professional Power. It handles even heavy pulverizing tasks with ease, and the double housing design keeps operation quiet. The 60 oz. BPA-free Tritan jar sits in a heavy-duty plastic base and is uniquely designed for easy pouring, with a soft-touch handle for a secure grip. This blender operates at the touch of a button, with Low Med and High speeds, Pulse and 9 pre-programmed Presets Included Smoothie and Ice Crush options.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>',99.99,NULL,9,NULL,11.75,'1',598,'a:3:{i:0;i:599;i:1;i:600;i:2;i:601;}','14.4','12.6','10.8','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,17,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 04:01:35','2019-01-23 04:01:35'),(204,40,17,'Pixelated Heart Ita Bag','pixelated-heart-ita-bag','','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/730/580/9cdc953c7a456c7c909d89b37da2b910_original.JPG?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;crop=faces&amp;w=1024&amp;h=576&amp;fit=crop&amp;v=1546961770&amp;auto=format&amp;frame=1&amp;q=92&amp;s=e6d76b4949aca46835c28de6a04baecf\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hello and thank you so much for your interest in my campaign! My name is Stephanie and I&#39;m the owner of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.geekthehalls.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Geek the Halls</a>. My shop was first known for hand-made ornaments inspired by&nbsp;our favorite geektastic fandoms. Over the past year, I&#39;ve become more known for my kawaii resin charms!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I&#39;m a huge pin collector (and have made a few designs for my shop) and love to display pins on my ita bags. With that, I wanted to design a bag that would be great for a retro/gamer aesthetic! I&#39;ve always loved pixelated hearts, so I knew this was the design I wanted to create.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/730/823/b1269d60265fe51d3e0ec1cbae5b409e_original.JPG?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1546963192&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=532b7e91f27df1618fef6a69fdedc7b0\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This project is specifically dedicated to help fund my most ambitious project ever, my pixelated heart ita backpack! The initial goal is to fund 200 of my original red and black bags (as seen in photos).&nbsp;<strong>The goal will be reached at $3,000 USD.</strong>&nbsp;Once that is successfully funded, other colorful, kawaii, pastel colors will be made available to unlock!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The bag is made out of faux leather and has two zippered sections. The first zippered section is a glittered, vinyl front window in the shape of a pixelated heart. It zips all the way to the bottom so you can add your own insert. The second section zips halfway down and contains 1 zippered pocket as well as two open pockets.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The second section can fit laptops and tablets that have a 15&quot; screen or smaller! It&#39;s the perfect back pack for conventions or to express your kawaii self on your school campus!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Overall Bag Size:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>12 inches in width&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>14 inches in height</li>\r\n	<li>4 inches in depth</li>\r\n	<li>(30.48cm x 35.56cm x 10.16cm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Window:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>10.5 inches in width</li>\r\n	<li>11 inches in height</li>\r\n	<li>(26.67cm x 27.94cm)&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Adjustable Back-Pack Straps:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>At their longest : 35&quot;&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>At their shortest: 20&quot;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/730/769/b70eefac25f2d4b3f3ed45fe744c7836_original.JPG?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1546962798&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=c73c3ed3188f6e55aa663a40bd9bdc79\" /></p>',2387,NULL,37,NULL,0.63,'1',602,NULL,'50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,13,NULL,16,0,52,2,43,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 04:01:36','2019-01-23 04:01:36'),(205,42,19,'Smart Screen Blender and Food Processor','smart-screen-blender-and-food-processor','','<ul>\r\n	<li>FreshVac Technology: The easy-to-use, one-touch, FreshVac Pump is designed to preserve vitamins, flavors, and colors by removing oxygen from your single cup or full-sized blender. Enjoy long-lasting drinks and smoothies with less foam and separation as compared to traditional blending mode.</li>\r\n	<li>9 Pre-Set Auto-iQ Programs: Smart Touchscreen reveals each vessel&#39;s Chef designed, automatic pre-set recipe programs.</li>\r\n	<li>Touchscreen Blender: Easy to clean, long lasting, and intuitive.</li>\r\n	<li>72 oz. FreshVac Pitcher: Transforms your favorite ingredients into smoothies, dips, and more with the Total Crushing Blades.</li>\r\n	<li>20 oz. Single-Serve FreshVac Cup for Nutrient &amp; Vitamin Extraction*. The powerful Pro Extractor Blades Assembly breaks down tough ingredients. *Extract a drink containing vitamins and nutrients from fruits and vegetables.</li>\r\n	<li>40 oz. Precision Processor: The Stacked Blades enable you to precisely chop, puree, mix, and even make dough.</li>\r\n	<li>The slicing/shredding disc for the food processor allows for quick and consistent prep of your favorite veggies.</li>\r\n</ul>',199,NULL,10,NULL,16.25,'1',603,'a:3:{i:0;i:604;i:1;i:605;i:2;i:606;}','8.86','10.82','17.32','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,17,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 04:13:43','2019-01-23 04:13:43'),(206,40,17,'Leather Satchel Bag','leather-satchel-bag','','<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/711/257/f05c2d839d9cea95b6910e9e500bd805_original.png?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;crop=faces&amp;w=1024&amp;h=576&amp;fit=crop&amp;v=1546769898&amp;auto=format&amp;frame=1&amp;q=92&amp;s=70437a7906a68b42906e816efb2d4462\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>More and more of us are carrying laptops phones books so why not do it in style with a bag build to last</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/711/238/bb6090cbcf7fb380cb939ee251fd0c69_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1546769719&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=f23d518b4d8e98bb44148491ecb280b6\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>working with a manufacturer i know and trust I designed it &nbsp;to be as functional as possible whilst still been slim line and usable every day use&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>the bag has a front button pocket two internal zipped pockets and three open pockets&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/730/004/db9d558b285ffb966dd51726e698672b_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1546957310&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=827817fdbedc3eea6f90419ae78516aa\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/730/001/86ae4181d40473508e8b55abffb2dd98_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1546957260&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=10a4f54d3c9b7b91f5599fc2333f427d\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Material&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>after looking at several types of leather the final desision was to have it made from high quality goat leather as it will get better with age every piece will be slightly different due to the handmade nature</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/023/711/248/fc5cad16d4a6ca0a9a531a81647962b6_original.jpg?ixlib=rb-1.1.0&amp;w=680&amp;fit=max&amp;v=1546769800&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=50&amp;q=92&amp;s=d38d8c6d0b238939f02c1b85908aa556\" /></p>',3310,NULL,141,NULL,0.63,'1',607,NULL,'50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,9,NULL,16,0,57,2,38,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 04:17:55','2019-01-23 04:17:55'),(207,42,19,'Art of Native America','art-of-native-america','','<p><strong>A fresh exploration of Native American art that positions the work within the broader context of North American art history</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis landmark publication presents Native American art within the broader context of American art history, through an examination of notable works from a major private collection. The insightful texts provide a new evaluation of the art, culture, and daily life of numerous North American tribes, including Acoma, Apache, Cheyenne, Creek, Crow, Hopi-Twea, Kiowa, Lakota, Pomo, Seneca, Seminole, Tlingit, and Zuni, among others.<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe works featured in this lavish volume span centuries, from the period prior to contact with European settlers through the early 20th century, and represent the extensive artistic achievements of culturally distinct indigenous peoples. Both known and unrecorded makers&rsquo; innovative visions are manifest in a wide variety of aesthetic forms and media&mdash;from painting, sculpture, and drawing to costume, ceramics, and baskets. Challenging traditional presentations of American Indian art, this publication situates and analyzes them alongside other North American artistic practices.</p>',32.37,NULL,10,NULL,3.2,'1',608,'a:1:{i:0;i:609;}','9.2','1.2','11.2','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,17,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 04:27:06','2019-01-23 04:27:06'),(208,42,19,'Golden State Art, Metal Wall Photo Frame Collection','golden-state-art-metal-wall-photo-frame-collection','','<p>With hook for hanging. The frame comes with the real glass, backboard and hook. It is a wonderful choice for a birthday, wedding or anniversary gift.</p>',39.99,NULL,3,NULL,8.7,'1',610,'a:2:{i:0;i:611;i:1;i:612;}','15.5','12.5','4.5','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,17,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 04:32:27','2019-01-23 04:32:27'),(209,42,19,'Paintings at the Art Institute of Chicago','paintings-at-the-art-institute-of-chicago','','<p><strong>An updated selection of key paintings at the Art Institute of Chicago, featuring works from around the globe and dating from ancient Egypt to the present day</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Art Institute of Chicago, one of the most beloved and important museums in the world, houses an extraordinary collection of objects from diverse places, cultures, and time periods. This beautiful catalogue opens the doors of the museum to readers, presenting an expansive selection of painted works from around the globe, introduced insightfully by James Rondeau, president and director of the Art Institute. New color photography accompanies entries written by a team of curators, art historians, and educators, which put the works into context. The book showcases a dazzling range of paintings, including an Egyptian funeral portrait, an ancient Mexican wall mural, Chinese scroll paintings, Japanese painted screens, and works by artists such as Caillebotte, Cassatt, El Greco, Gauguin, Homer, Hopper, Johns, Lichtenstein, Matisse, Mitsuoki, Monet, Morisot, Motley, O&rsquo;Keeffe, Picasso, Pollock, Rembrandt, Richter, Rubens, Sargent, Seurat, Tiepolo, Turner, Van Gogh, Warhol, Whistler, and Wood; contemporary artists featured include Kerry James Marshall, Wanda Pimentel, and Kazuo Shiraga.</p>',32.87,NULL,9,NULL,3.4,'1',613,NULL,'11.2','1','11.2','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,17,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 04:36:30','2019-01-23 04:36:30'),(210,42,19,'The Metropolitan Museum of Art','the-metropolitan-museum-of-art','','<p>In line with best-selling&nbsp;<em>The Louvre: All the Paintings</em>, and Rizzoli&#39;s successful&nbsp;<em>The Hermitage Collections</em>and&nbsp;<em>The Barnes Foundation: Masterworks</em>, this title offers an exquisite tour, unique in its lavish illustration, scholarship, extent, and graceful packaging. As the first large survey published in 30 years, and the first large general survey of the Met&#39;s paintings collection it is the first to celebrate the greatest and most iconic paintings of one of the largest, most important, and most beloved museums in the world. This impressive book&rsquo;s broad sweep of material, all from a single museum, makes it at once a universal history of painting and the ideal introduction to the iconic masterworks of this world-renowned institution. Lavish color illustrations and details of 500 masterpieces, created over 5,000 years in cultures across the globe, are presented chronologically from the dawn of civilization to the present. These works represent a grand tour of painting from ancient Egypt and classical antiquity and prized Byzantine and medieval altarpieces, to paintings from Asia, India, Africa, and the Americas and the greatest European and North American masters. This unprecedented book includes an introduction and illuminating texts about each artwork written by Kathryn Calley Galitz, whose experience as both a curator and educator at the Met makes her uniquely qualified. European and American artists include Duccio, El Greco, Raphael, Titian, Botticelli, Bronzino, Caravaggio, Turner, Vel&aacute;zquez, Goya, Rubens, Rembrandt, Brueghel, Vermeer, David, Renoir, Monet, Van Gogh, Gauguin, C&eacute;zanne, Degas, Sargent, Homer, Matisse, Picasso, Pollock, and Warhol. For those wishing to experience the Met&rsquo;s unparalleled collection or to study masterpieces of painting from throughout history, this important volume is sure to become a classic cherished by art lovers around the world. &nbsp;Iconic works in the Met include: Sargent&#39;s Madame X, Velazquez Juan de Pareja, Brueghel The Harvesters, Van Gogh Cypresses; Rembrandt Aristotle and Bust of Homer; Pollock Autumn Rhythm; Emanuel Leutz George Washington Crossing the Delaware; El Greco View of Toledo; Caravaggio Musicians; Vermeer Young Woman with Water Pitcher; Monet Water Lilies; Picasso Seated Harlequin.</p>',50.99,NULL,9,NULL,4,'1',614,'a:0:{}','9.8','2.1','13.5','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,17,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 04:40:08','2019-04-02 12:13:39'),(211,42,19,'The Orléans Collection Hardcover','the-orl-ans-collection-hardcover','','<p>This magnificent new volume presents works of art from the fabled collection of Philippe II, Duke of Orl&eacute;ans (1674-1723)&mdash;including masterpieces by Raphael, Titian, Veronese, Correggio, Poussin, Rubens, and Rembrandt&mdash;bringing them together for the first time since the collection&rsquo;s sale and dispersal more than two hundred years ago. In this book a representative group of nearly forty works&mdash;paintings, books, engravings, and portraits&mdash;tell the story of the collection&#39;s formation and exceptional character, focusing on such themes as the importance of the collection in the duke&rsquo;s lifetime; the art market in early eighteenth-century Paris; the display of the collection in public and private spaces; and its widespread fame and resulting impact on visitors and contemporary artists and collectors in Paris.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This volume is both a celebration of the tricentennial of the city of New Orleans, as well as being a major contribution to art historical scholarship and is of great interest to art historians and collectors, as well as to the general public. The volume is structured to maximize scholarly interest, publish new research and consolidate what is known about Phillippe II&rsquo;s collection, one of the greatest private collections of Western art ever assembled.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It features contributions by an international array of leading scholars, including Fran&ccedil;oise Mardrus, Louvre Museum; Nicole Garnier-Pelle, Mus&eacute;e Cond&eacute;; Alexandre Dupilet, author and historian; Xavier Salomon, The Frick Collection; Rachel McGarry, Minneapolis Institute of Art; Julia Armstrong-Totten, formerly of the Getty Provenance Index; Jean-Fran&ccedil;ois B&eacute;dard of Syracuse University; and Kelsey Brosnan, curatorial fellow for European Art at New Orleans Museum of Art.</p>',34.4,NULL,10,NULL,4,'1',615,NULL,'9.8','1','11.2','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,17,0,50,2,45,'all',NULL,NULL,0,0,'2019-01-23 04:46:47','2019-01-23 04:46:47'),(212,16,18,'Michael Kors MK3867 Watch Silver Bracelet Blue Watch 100% Genuine BNWT','michael-kors-mk3867-watch-silver-bracelet-blue-watch-100-genuine-bnwt','','<table align=\"center\" style=\"width:1107px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<pre>\r\n<var>YOU ARE BUYING a Michael Kors MK3867 Watch- RRP &euro;219\r\n\r\nSilver clip bracelet, Gorgeous floral design.\r\n\r\nComes in Box\r\n\r\nPerfect Christmas Present\r\n\r\n\r\n100% GENUINE\r\n\r\nBRAND NEW WITH TAGS\r\n\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE that Picture might have a Different size but you will be getting this item in the Size stated in the Listing!\r\n\r\nThis item might be available in other sizes, please ask if you are looking for a different size\r\n\r\nPlease subscribe to My Newsletter for offers and New Listings as I constantly update my collection, so be the First to see it to Snatch it :) (add my shop to your favourites)\r\n\r\nI am selling lots more Designer items and childrens Designer clothes, so follow me and see my other items once I upload all!\r\n\r\nPlease message me if you want to see all that I&#39;m selling, not everything is listed here, I have lots of fab kids designer clothes and shoes! \r\n\r\nAll the items I sell are sourced only directly from Manufacturer, their original stores and outlets. ALL Brand New with Tags and ONLY 100% GENUINE.\r\n\r\nMost of the items I sell are discounted %, Selling everything at fraction of original price, so grab yourself a bargain! All original Burberry, Baby Dior, Versace, Ralph Lauren, Hacket, Armani, Kenzo, Ted Baker, Timberland, Tommy Hilfiger, Michael Kors, Cavalli, MK, etc. \r\n\r\nCollection from N10, Postage anywhere, please ask. I dispatch within 3 days but usually the f