eatures. Tell buyers a bit about your process or the story</p>',45,NULL,10,NULL,5,'2',682,NULL,'2','3','2','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,5,NULL,29,0,50,2,45,'all','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YTR21os8gTA',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-01 05:43:23','2021-07-13 09:07:39'),(234,12,36,'Oregon Wild Rice','oregon-wild-rice','','<p>Oregon Wild Rice is naturally delicious and nutritious and a unique variety of mother nature&rsquo;s wild-growing rice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It&rsquo;s is grown exclusively in Western Oregon&rsquo;s South Willamette Valley. Oregon Rice is gluten-free, all-natural, and has a hardy texture and a rich flavor. We are fortunate that Oregon and its Willamette Valley offer some of the most nutrient-rich soils on the planet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Western Oregon&rsquo;s fertile soil and abundant, pure rainwater make Oregon Rice a natural superfood. The winter rains fill the rice ponds or &ldquo;paddies&rdquo; throughout the winter months and provide ample clear, clean water for the wild rice to grow to full maturity in Oregon&rsquo;s spring and summer sunshine.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Oregon Rice is carefully harvested in late July and early August as the lush, green plant naturally ripens to a golden brown color. It requires no sprays or pesticides and it is naturally organic and superior to all other rice in taste and texture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1lb of Oregon Rice makes about 8 cups of cooked wild rice. Oregon Rice is a complementary addition to any meal or food item you already enjoy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This product will keep indefinitely in your pantry. Keep out of direct sunlight. Store in a cool dry place.</p>',29.99,NULL,9,'N/A',1,'1',684,NULL,'1','200','200','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,20,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-07 10:28:33','2021-07-07 10:30:24'),(235,12,36,'Garlic Dill Relish','garlic-dill-relish','','<h1 data-fontsize=\"26\" data-lineheight=\"35.88px\" itemprop=\"name\">Garlic Dill Relish</h1>',8,NULL,5,'N/A',1,'1',686,NULL,'5','5','5','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,20,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-07 11:32:08','2021-07-07 11:32:32'),(236,67,38,'Garlic Bread & Butter Relish','garlic-bread-butter-relish','','<h1 data-fontsize=\"26\" data-lineheight=\"35.88px\" itemprop=\"name\">Garlic Bread &amp; Butter Relish</h1>',8,NULL,0,'N/A',1,'1',687,NULL,'5','5','5','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,26,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-07 12:05:29','2021-07-07 12:06:30'),(237,12,36,'Rumiano\'s Best','rumiano-s-best','','<p>Our Rumiano&rsquo;s Best box is sure to be a crowd-pleaser! Enjoy our famous cheeses all together in one pack. These include our Smoked Cheddar which has been smoked using hand-built fires and our Dry Monterey Jack wedges that have been aging in our hand-dug cellars at our Willows facility. This pack is great to enjoy with a glass of wine and your favorite company!</p>',25,NULL,4,'N/A',1,'1',689,NULL,'5','100','100','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,20,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-07 12:58:01','2021-07-07 12:58:13'),(238,12,36,'Salty Easter Bunny','salty-easter-bunny','','<p><strong>Calling all salt lovers! Enjoy savory Olli Toscano Salami, with a slice of Dry Jack, atop a crunchy Rustic Bakery Sel Gris and Olive Oil cracker. To keep your taste buds hopping, we&rsquo;ve added our spicy Chipotle White Cheddar, all-natural Smoked Mozzarella, and a sweet surprise with Chico Honey Co. Wildflower Honey and Faberge Eggs. This box is sure to leave even the saltiest bunny with a smile! &nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Rumiano Dry Jack</strong>&nbsp;- A little salty-sweet combo, our flagship cheese is sure to wow your sweetie! Our Dry Monterey Jack is aged for a minimum of 6 months in our original, hand-dug cellar. No need to buy flowers when you can drizzle a bit of Wildflower Honey on this classic for a light botanical infusion!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Smoked Mozzarella</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;All naturally smoked, our Smoked Mozzarella is a repeat ACS Award Winning Cheese. A savory bite that draws you in for &ldquo;just one more bite&rdquo;&hellip;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>8oz. Rumiano Crafted Chipotle White Cheddar</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;The Chipotle White Cheddar combines the sharp cream of our cheddar with the colorful, smokey-spice of chipotle peppers. This spicy variety rivals our Jalapeno Jack in scoville units and is just as smooth and creamy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Chico Honey Wildflower Honey</strong>&nbsp;- This California Wildflower Honey is a mellow, golden color with a complex flavor and smooth finish. Not just for cheese, this honey pairs well with a crafted cocktail!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2.6oz. Rustic Bakery Faberge Eggs</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;These eggs were originally created for the Russian Emperial family in the 18-1900s. Today, these replica buttery sugar cookie eggs are glazed with a sweet royal icing that adds the perfect sweetness to your cheeseboard. &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Rustic Bakery Sel Gris and Olive Oil&nbsp;Flatbread Bites</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;From their artisan bakery in Marin County, just over the Golden Gate Bridge, Rustic Bakery produces the most delicious light and flaky, baked by hand flatbread crackers featuring nutritious, organic ingredients like grey sea salt and extra virgin olive oil. A perfect complement to any cheese.</p>',50,NULL,5,'N/A',1,'1',691,'a:1:{i:0;i:692;}','8','20','20','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,20,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-07 13:07:58','2021-07-07 13:08:14'),(239,12,36,'The fighter SEASONING SALT','the-fighter-seasoning-salt','','<p><strong>Details:</strong><br />\r\nThis pink Himalayan sea salt infused with roots, herbs, fruits, veggies, adaptogens &amp; mushrooms will give any meal a healthy boost! We take the strained solids from a batch of The Fighter fire tonic, dehydrate &amp; grind them down with salt. A tasty way to add some flavor to your life!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Usage:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The perfect finishing touch to any dish; from vegetables &amp; meat to avocado toast &amp; a bloody mary garnish, fire salt belongs on your spice rack!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Ingredients (Organic):</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pink Himalayan salt, raw apple cider vinegar*, onion*, ginger*, garlic*, horseradish root*, turmeric*, cinnamon chips*, rosehips*, burdock root*, elderberries*, black peppercorns*, cayenne pepper*, ashwagandha root*, astragalus root*, reishi mushroom*, yarrow*, echinacea root*, echinacea herb*, lemon juice &amp; rind*, grapefruit juice &amp; rind*, Chaga mushroom*, rosemary*, thyme*, oregano*, jalape&ntilde;o pepper*, haba&ntilde;ero pepper*</p>',9,NULL,0,'N/A',1,'1',694,NULL,'5','100','100','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,20,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-07 13:23:53','2021-07-07 13:24:05'),(240,12,36,'The classic FIRE TONIC','the-classic-fire-tonic','','<p><strong>Details:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>An invigorating raw apple cider vinegar extract packed with power plants. Our SPICY, sweet, tangy elixir uses medicinal botanicals to promote immune function, digestive health, &amp; reduced inflammation. The Classic is our most basic blend inspired by simple &amp; traditional fire cider recipes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Usage:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Take 1 tbsp as needed 1-3x per day. For more acute symptoms or illnesses, sip throughout the day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Ingredients:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Raw apple cider vinegar*, onion*, raw Oregon blackberry honey, ginger*, garlic*, horseradish root*, turmeric*, black peppercorns*, lemon juice &amp; rind*, thyme*, cayenne pepper*, haba&ntilde;ero pepper*</p>',22,NULL,0,'N/A',1,'1',695,NULL,'5','50','88','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,20,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-07 13:28:57','2021-07-07 13:29:24'),(241,12,36,'SWEET SAVORY','sweet-savory','','<p>Well, what can we say? A touch of sweet sugar with cinnamon. Just right. If you like nuts and you like sweet then this is the one for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Properties:</b></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Heart Healthy</li>\r\n	<li>Brain Boosting</li>\r\n	<li>Rich in Antioxidants</li>\r\n	<li>Boosts Metabolism</li>\r\n	<li>Good source of Protein</li>\r\n	<li>High Energy Food</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Perks:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\">Gluten-Free</li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\">Cholesterol Free (0mg)</li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\">Sodium 0mg</li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\">200 Calories per Serving</li>\r\n	<li aria-level=\"1\">Plant-based Protein 4g (8%)</li>\r\n	<li>Manufactured in a Peanut-Free Facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<section>&nbsp;</section>',16.99,NULL,1,'N/A',0.3125,'1',697,NULL,'5','10','10','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,20,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-07 13:46:19','2021-07-07 13:46:33'),(242,12,36,'Garbanzo Beans','garbanzo-beans','','<h1 data-content-field=\"title\" id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1625730486445_528\">Garbanzo Beans</h1>',6.5,NULL,0,'N/A',1,'1',700,NULL,'1','1','1','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,20,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-08 07:57:18','2021-07-08 07:57:31'),(243,12,36,'Purple Karma Barley Flakes','purple-karma-barley-flakes','','<p>An ancient Himalayan landrace variety revived by the Oregon State Barley Project, we grow this purple-tinged barley on our very own Hunton&#39;s farm. Hearty, nutty, and toasty, Purple Karma Barley is excellent as a breakfast cereal or added to your favorite baked goods.</p>',7.5,NULL,1,'N/A',1.5,'1',704,NULL,'1','1','1','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,20,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-08 08:08:41','2021-07-08 08:08:54'),(244,12,36,'Sunflower Seed Butter','sunflower-seed-butter','','<p>Our Fresh Ground Process gives our nut butter its unique taste and texture and allows us to preserve the integrity of all the wonderful ingredients. Our dry roasted sunflower seeds are blended with cold-pressed sunflower oil, which is high in Omega 3&rsquo;s and 6&rsquo;s. Our organic, non-GMO honey can help with allergies, is good for gastrointestinal health, and is low on the glycemic index. You won&rsquo;t experience a sugar crash on a spoonful of Sunflower Butter Bliss. We also use a hint of sea salt, keeping this product as simple as possible. The end result is a tasty treat that is great for the body and good for the soul.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So simple. So healthy. &nbsp;So Blissful. Spoonfuls are dangerous</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But best of all?</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>All of our Bliss Nut Butters taste just blissful!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Nutrition Facts&nbsp;&nbsp;</b>Serv. Size 2 Tbsp (32g), Servings About 11, Amount Per Serving:&nbsp;<b>Calories&nbsp;</b>200, Calories from Fat 160,&nbsp;<b>Total Fat</b>&nbsp;17g (27% DV), Sat. Fat 2g (9% DV),&nbsp;<i>Trans</i>&nbsp;Fat 0g,&nbsp;<b>Sodium</b>&nbsp;170mg (6% DV),&nbsp;<b>Total Carbohydrate</b>&nbsp;8g (3% DV), Dietary Fiber 2g (9% DV), Sugars 4g,&nbsp;<b>Protein</b>&nbsp;4g, Vitamin A (0% DV),&nbsp;Vitamin C (0% DV) Calcium (0% DV), Iron (4% DV).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Percent Daily Values (DV) are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Ingredients&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Roasted sunflower seeds, sunflower seed oil, organic raw honey, sea salt.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Allergenic Warning&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Contains Peanuts. Made in a facility that processes peanuts, tree nuts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Best if refrigerated after opening. Stir well, ingredients tend to settle after shipping.</p>',8,NULL,0,'N/A',1,'1',706,NULL,'1','1','1','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,20,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-08 09:03:31','2021-07-08 09:03:45'),(245,12,36,'Chia Seed Peanut Butter Bliss','chia-seed-peanut-butter-bliss','','<p>Packed with antioxidants and low on the glycemic index, Chia Seed Peanut Butter Bliss is all-natural peanut butter made with dry roasted peanuts, nutrient-rich chia seeds, honey produced right here in the Pacific Northwest, heart-healthy oils, and a hint of sea salt. There are no preservatives, no additives, and our peanut butter is packaged in a glass jar that is recyclable, sustainable, and reusable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our Fresh Ground Process gives our nut butter its unique taste and texture and allows us to preserve the integrity of all the wonderful ingredients. Our dry roasted peanuts are blended with roasted peanut oil and cold-pressed sunflower oil, which are high in Omega 3&rsquo;s and 6&rsquo;s. Our organic, non-GMO honey can help with allergies, is good for gastrointestinal health, and is low on the glycemic index. You won&rsquo;t experience a sugar crash on a spoonful of Peanut Butter Bliss. Chia seeds are added for a nutritional super boost. We also use a hint of sea salt, keeping this product as simple as possible. The end result is a tasty treat that is great for the body and good for the soul.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So simple. So healthy. &nbsp;So Blissful. Spoonfuls are dangerous</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But best of all?</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>All of our Bliss Nut Butters taste just blissful!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Nutrition Facts&nbsp;&nbsp;</b>Serv. Size 2 Tbsp (32g), Servings About 11, Amount Per Serving:&nbsp;<b>Calories&nbsp;</b>170, Calories from Fat 120,&nbsp;<b>Total Fat</b>&nbsp;14g (21% DV), Sat. Fat 2g (10% DV),&nbsp;<i>Trans</i>&nbsp;Fat 0g,&nbsp;<b>Sodium</b>&nbsp;150mg (6% DV),&nbsp;<b>Total Carbohydrate</b>&nbsp;10g (3% DV), Dietary Fiber 2g (9% DV), Sugars 5g,&nbsp;<b>Protein</b>&nbsp;6g, Vitamin A (0% DV), Calcium (0% DV), Iron (4% DV).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Percent Daily Values (DV) are based on a 2,000 calorie diet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Ingredients&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;USA peanuts, peanut oil, organic raw honey, sea salt, chia seeds.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Allergenic Warning&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Contains Peanuts. Made in a facility that processes peanuts, tree nuts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Best if refrigerated after opening. Stir well, ingredients tend to settle after shipping</p>',8,NULL,0,'N/A',1,'1',707,NULL,'1','1','1','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,20,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-08 09:13:32','2021-07-08 09:13:45'),(246,67,38,'Include keywords that buyers would use to search for your item.','include-keywords-that-buyers-would-use-to-search-for-your-item','',NULL,10,NULL,10,NULL,50,'2',713,'a:1:{i:0;i:714;}','1','1','1','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,26,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-12 11:20:23','2021-07-12 11:21:44'),(247,67,38,'Light bulb','light-bulb','',NULL,50,NULL,94,NULL,25,'1',718,'a:1:{i:0;i:719;}','2','2','1','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,6,NULL,27,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-13 05:25:18','2021-07-13 12:18:24'),(248,101,42,'Wedding','wedding','',NULL,20,NULL,6,NULL,40,'1',721,'a:1:{i:0;i:722;}','40','40','40','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,14,NULL,30,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-13 08:49:44','2021-07-13 08:59:09'),(249,101,42,'Organic','organic','',NULL,40,NULL,50,NULL,50,'1',723,'a:1:{i:0;i:728;}','50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,30,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-13 09:00:21','2021-07-14 10:15:25'),(250,99,41,'Watches','watches','',NULL,200,NULL,333,NULL,50,'3',724,'a:0:{}','50','50','50','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,32,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-14 06:50:43','2021-07-14 07:22:24'),(251,99,41,'Wedding','wedding-417826','',NULL,40,NULL,46,NULL,30,'1',725,NULL,'30','30','30','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,4,NULL,32,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-14 07:20:02','2021-07-14 07:20:25'),(252,99,41,'Wedding','wedding-535416','',NULL,500,NULL,0,'789',20,'1',726,'a:1:{i:0;i:727;}','20','20','20','variant',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,33,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-14 07:41:37','2021-07-14 07:42:01'),(253,99,41,'Art','art','',NULL,66,NULL,55,NULL,70,'1',729,NULL,'70','70','70','simple',NULL,NULL,'0',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,33,0,50,2,45,'all','',NULL,0,0,'2021-07-15 05:04:43','2021-07-15 05:07:16');
