asonable when it comes to price. These are the top 5 luxury women watches of 2021 Sveston has in store for you.</p>',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,24,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2021-06-30 07:56:12','2021-07-01 06:05:10'),(41,99,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'DHA','ShopZit','shopzit','54000','716','03094780033','2','1','Shopzit.blaze.net',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,25,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2021-07-13 05:12:20','2021-07-14 06:53:01'),(42,101,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Model town lahore','Umar store','umar-store','5400','720','123456789','2','1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Very good products',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,26,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2021-07-13 08:09:19','2021-07-14 09:44:36');
